<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Wɔlɔme</para>
  <para style="toc1">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛi É Teʋeni Wɔlɔme Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wɔlɔme</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wɔl</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛi <optbreak/> É Teʋeni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Wɔlɔme Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔle ɠa é sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛɛni, é teʋe Wɔlɔme nuiti ma, tanisu kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔ maazu naanigɔiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ta puulɔɔlugɔ maazu lɔsaʋai (54-58), Kilista zɔlɔɔga ʋoluma. Pɔle la ɠɛni dɛ liini Wɔlɔme. É sɛʋɛi nii leʋeni mu, nii a kɛ é Wɔlɔme ɠeletiɛinti kala, Zuifuiti ta niiti ti la ga Zuifua. Kolɛnte taa wolai zu ɠa Pɔle yɛni ná, é sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛ, tɔɔzei miná ɠa é ɠɛni zeini ná naama ziɛgi zu. Pɔle sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛʋɛ, nii a kɛ ziiti pɛ ti ɠidaaleʋe Yesu Kilista ma, ta ti ɠolo bɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 16:26">16:26</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Wɔlɔme nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi ɠa ga sɛʋɛ ɓii gola keletiɛinti pɛ faa ma, mini-o-mini ta yeeɠɛɠalaiti pɛ su, tɔɔzei kizogi nii da zoo sɔlɔɔsu ga Yesu Kilista maaʋele, é naa zuɠulaʋɛ, é kole fo, é zeeli kpo ma. Ʋelei ɓalaa Yesu Kilista ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔiti giliai la ʋa ta Minazeɠe Pɔlɔmai, Pɔle naa zuɠulaʋɛ. Faaɠwɛ nu mɔinmɔingaa ti ɠɛ puuzui ma ɓii golai sɛʋɛi nii zu, naa ɠa é ga 1:16, nii é ɠɛɛzu ma: «Mazɔlɔɔ gè la unfesu ga Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi, tɔɔzei GALA ná-zɛbɛi ɠana, nii é naati pɛ kizosu da, niiti ta ɠidaaleʋe, Zuifuiti mɔunpa, naa ʋoluma niiti ti la ga Zuifua.» Wɔlɔme nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizu ʋelei (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:1-11:36">1:1—11:36</ref></char>) ɠa ɓɔɛzu ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛ, é lo GALA faiti ba. Gaaɓelasu ʋelei (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:33">12:1—15:33</ref></char>) ɠa ga kalagiti é lo keletiɛn ʋelei ziɛ vai ʋa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Ʋelei kɛɛ vaa wɔlɔmai la, Pɔle ná-sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeiʋɛ ga é ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛ, ta é naati dɛɛ niiti sɛʋɛi liizu ti ʋɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:1-15">1:1-15</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Naa ʋoluma é etea nuɓusɛi pɛ kɛʋelei zuɠula, ta kizogi nii a zoo zɔlɔɔsu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele Yesu Kilista ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:16-11:36">1:16—11:36</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Pɔle ɓegai ma ga naati suɠula, é kala mɔinmɔin feeni, é lo keletiɛn ʋelei ziɛ vai ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:33">12:1—15:33</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. É Wɔlɔme nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi ɠaaɓelagɛ ga tuʋɔ goo mɔinmɔin daazeeli Wɔlɔme Egilisii zu nui tanigaa ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 16:1-27">16:1-27</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ gooiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Nɛ̀i gè ga Pɔle, nà niima zɛʋɛi leʋesu wo ma, nà ga Yesu Kilista ná-botiɠɛ nui, GALA ge tòligai gè ɠɛ ga keelai, ziimazeɠegi wogai ga ze ga gè Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli. <verse eid="ROM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi naa, kaite GALA ge ma minazeɠegi woni ná-Sɛʋɛ Ɲadegai zu, é ɠula GALA goo wo nuiti da. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>Pilɛgɛ ná-Doun Zunui ʋa, de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista, nii é zɔlɔɔni masagi Davide ná-bolodai zu, kpusɛi letemazu. <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zaalai zu, é ɠulani kɛlɛma ga zɛbɛi ga toɠa ga GALA Doun Zunui, siɛgi zu é wuzeɠeni la, é ɠula saai ya. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Tɔun maaʋele ɠa gè zaalai zɔlɔɔga la, gè ɠɛ ga keelai, gè ʋa ga nuiti daaseigi zu, ti ɠula zii ɠiligiti saama, ti ɠidaaleʋe ma, ti ɠolo bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Wa naama nuɓusɛiti saama, wɔiti GALA ge wo loliga, ga wo ɠɛ ga Yesu Kilista nɔnɔiti.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Nà sɛʋɛi nii leʋesu wo ma, wɔiti kpein wo Wɔlɔme taazuʋɛ, wɔiti GALA ge wo nɛai ʋɛ, é wo loli ga wo ɠɛ ga ná-nuiti. Ade-Ɠɛɛ GALA ta de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ti zaalai la wo ma, ti ziilɛigi ve wo ʋɛ.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ta Wɔlɔme ɠidaaleʋe nuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Mɔunpa, nà nà-GALAGI mamasu Yesu Kilista maaʋele ma, wo pɛ wa-vaa zu, mazɔlɔɔ wa-ɠidaaleʋe vai ɠa wosu eteai zu ná pɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Nà-GALA falii pɛ su, gè la ɓɔlɔzu ga wa-vai wo fai, yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ su. GALAGI nii gè botii ɠɛɛzu bɛ ga zìimaʋɛ pɛ, gè ɗa Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli, nii pilɛgai ná-Doun Zunui ʋa, naa ɠa é ga nà-zeelei. <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>Siɛnɔpɛ su gè nà-GALA falii ɠɛɛzu la, nà GALA falizu ga é ɠɛ ga ziimai, é yeeɠɛɠala ʋagɔ ve zèa, gè li wo ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wo ʋɛtɛ wɔin ɠa mà gola, ga gè ʋa wo ʋɔ ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-vebɛanii ta, wo zu ʋa ɓaa. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Ɓaa mu, nà pɔ gè ɠɛ wo zaama, ade iɲɔdɔɔi zɔlɔɔ ʋɔɔma ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele, nii ade ɓɔgai ma.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nà pɔ wo suɠwɛɛ ga gè deveni yeeɠɛɠala mɔinmɔin daawu, ga gè li wo ʋɔ bɛ, gè la ná zɔlɔɔni zaaɠaza. Gè ɠɛni pɔ ga tɔnɔ ge zɔlɔɔ nà-botii ʋa ɓalaa wo ʋɔ bɛ, eɠɛʋelei é zɔlɔɔsu la ba, zii ɠiligi mɔtaiti saama eteai zu. <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ deve ɠa feai zèa, ga kɛni gè lɔ ɛsɛ pɛ ma: Gɛlɛkiiti ta zii ɠiligiti, nuiti ti ɠalagai ta nuiti ti la ɠalani ɓalaa. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Naa ɠa é ba, wɔin wola ɠa mà, ga gè Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli wo ma, wɔiti wo zeini Wɔlɔme taazuʋɛ.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ná-zobogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gè la unfesu ga Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi, tɔɔzei GALA ná-zɛbɛi ɠana, nii é naati pɛ kizosu da, niiti ta ɠidaaleʋe, Zuifuiti mɔunpa, naa ʋoluma niiti ti la ga Zuifua. <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Tɔɔzei Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ɠa dɛɛzu, ʋelei GALA ge nuiti kɛɛzu la ɠaazu ga telebo nu ga kidaaleʋei ɠila kpe maaʋele, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: «Zɔi telebogai GALA gaazu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele, naa ɠa zɛnvui wo.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Aɓk 2:4</ref></char>. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zɔi telebogai GALA gaazu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele, naa ɠa zɛnvui wo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Telebo nui ɠa zɛnvui wo ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele</char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta ga sɔba nuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Tama GALA ge ná-ziiɠaawanai ɠulaa kɛlɛma, é zo geeɠɔlɔgi zu, kotoi kpein daalɔɠɔma ta faa ɲɔiti pɛ nuɓusɛi kɛɛzu, ta pele ɓesasu gaamai luɠɔ ga ti luʋa ʋele ɲɔiti. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nii maanɛai nu kwɛɛ GALA ná-fai zu, naa ɠulaʋɛ kɛlɛma ti ʋɛ, GALA ɓɔɠɔi naa lɛɛʋɛ ga tiye kpezekele. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Tɔɔzei GALA daazeeliʋɛ fai pɛ su, nu ɠaazu la naa pɛ kaazu, ná-ɠɔoɠɔ zɛbɛi, ta ná-galadai, naa ɠa ɠaazu ga pagɔ, é zo eteai ɓɛtɛ yee ma, siɛgi zu nu ti ʋɛtɛsu da ga ná-kpɛtɛaniiti maaʋele. Naa ɠa é ba, goozuɠula ge la ti ya.<verse eid="ROM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Ti GALA kwɛɛ, kɛlɛ ti la dɛbizu, ʋelei maanɛai é ɠɛ la GALA bɛ, ti la mamasu. Kɛlɛ ti ɓɔɠɔ loa ya ta-ɠisiɛ ɲakaiti su, ta-ɠimalalai ti lɔa kpidi ɓɔii zu. <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Ti ɠɛa ɓɔɠɔ levezu ga ɠima nuiti, kɛlɛ ti ɠɛa ga ɠimalala nuiti. <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>Ti ɠɛlɛni nɔkɔsu lɛbiya ƓALAGI wu, nii é la zaa pɛ, ti ɗa nɔkɔ kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti bu: nuɓusɛi é zaazu naa maaniinigi, ta wɔniiti, ta ɠɔɠɔ naani suaiti, naa ʋɛɛ kpokpo suaiti ba.<verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Naa ɠa é ba, GALA ge ti yɛga kɔzɔba vaiti su, eɠɛʋelei ti yiima vaiti ti la, nii a kɛ ti ɗa ɓaaɠula ti-ɓusɛiti ma ɓɔɠɔ yɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Gaamai nii é ʋilɛsu GALA ná-fai ʋa, ti naa pɛ maavalibogɛ ga zɛɛi, ti ɗa nɔkɔ ani ɓɛtɛaiti bu, ti ɗa ti lɛbi, ti Aniiti Kpɛtɛ ƓALAGI yɛ ná. Mamagi ɠɛ bɛ, eyɛsu ɠɔ. Amina!<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Naa ɠa é kɛa, GALA ge ti yɛga topele ɲɔi ma ɓaaɠulamaiti daawu. Ti zaama, anzanuiti ta zunu lakobai maavalibosu, ti ɗa laa ɓɔɠɔ ɠoba. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Zunuiti ɓalaagi ta ɠɛlɛzu anzanu lakobai ʋa, ti ɗa ɠalasu ga ti ɠaazuɠula ɓɔɠɔ ʋa ti ɠilagilagiti, zunuiti ti ɗa ɓaaɠulama vai ɠɛ ga ɓɔɠɔ, zunui ta zunui, tama ta naama zalai zɔlɔɔsu ɠɔlɔ su, nii soloogai ta-looya vai ma.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Tɛi ti ɠɛlɛa, GALA kwɛɛ ziizoolɛ la ti ma, GALA ge ti yɛni ta ɠi supuiti su, ga ti ɗa naa ɠɛ, nii maa la nɛɛni ga ti kɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Ti laavegɛ ga telebotala vai ma zii pɛ, ta suɲɔulai, ta koozu yii, ta keleɠele ɲɔi. Ti laavegɛ ɓalaa ga tolo ɲɔi, ta nu ʋaa vai, ta kpɔɛ vai, ta yaavai, ta unsuɲɔi, ta zɔɠɔzuziɛgi. <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>Ta ga tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠolo nuiti ta GALA sili nuiti. Ta ga gaazulɛɛ nuiti, gaazumaanɛɛ nuiti, ta ɓɔɠɔ vaa lɛsu nuiti. Ta ga faa ɲɔu niina lɔɔzei nuiti ta ti zɔlɔɔ nuiti goozotala nuiti. <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>Ta ga kibalama nuiti, minazeɠe sotala nuiti, maayotala nuiti, ta ti la nu maawɔinɠaa. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Anɛɛ ni ti GALA ná-devei ɠwɛɛ, ga niiti ti ziɛzu ga naama vaiti, saai ɠa soloogai ti ma, kɛlɛ tɔun ti la ɠwɛsu kɛɛ vai letelegi nɔ ʋa, kɛni ti ɗa naa ɠɛɠala vaa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti maamusɛ.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Ɗa ʋe, ɗɛi è zɔiti tukpɔɠaaleʋezu, deɠɛmu goozuɠula nɔpɛ ge la è ya, è ɠɛni ga nui ma zii nɔpɛ. Mazɔlɔɔ siɛgi zu è zɔiti peelalazu la, ɗa ɓɔɠɔi ma è ɗa ziɛ ga ti ɠɛʋele, ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ʋeelalazu ɗa ɓɔɠɔi. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>De kwɛni ga GALA ka naa ɠɛɠala ɠɛɛwotiiti kɛ nuiti tukpɔɠaaleʋezu gaamai zu. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Ɗa ɠisiɛzu ga GALA ge la è ʋeelalaa ɓaa, ɗɛi è nuiti peelalazu, niiti ti naama vaiti kɛɛzu, tama è ɗa kɛɠalai ɠɛ? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Ɓaa, ɗa GALA ná-nuɓɔɠɔla wolai ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛsu, ta ná-ziilɔɔi, ta ná-faanɛɛi? È la kwɛni ɓaa, ga GALA ná-nuɓɔɠɔlai ɠa è mɛɛnsu, ga è è-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo? <verse eid="ROM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Kɛlɛ eɠɛʋelei è-ɠigi ɓaazu la, è la vaazu bu è-yiimaʋɛ maa ʋa valibo, ɗa GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai maalolisu ɓɔɠɔ ma, naama yiiɠaawana volo ná, yeei é tukpɔi ɠaaleʋezu la ga telebodai. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Toɠa «ɛsɛ gilagilagi zalai ve zea, eɠɛʋelei ná-kɛɛwotiiti ti la.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 62:13">Guy 62:13</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Toɠa ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui ve naati zea, niiti ti ɠaaɓaazu, ti ɗa faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ, ti lɛbiyai ɠaiziɛzu, ta bɔɔlɔi, ta saalalai. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Kɛlɛ toɠa ziiɠaawanai ta ziiɠulagi ɠula kɛlɛma naati daalɔɠɔma, niiti ti unzɛgai sakpegi ma, ti la ɠoloni gaamai ʋɛ, kɛni ti ɗa ɠolo telebotalai ʋɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Kpɔlɔi ta kidaaʋiligi, naati ka ti naama nuɓusɛi kpein maaɓɔunsu, niiti ti faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛzu, Zuifuiti mɔunpa, naa ʋoluma niiti ti la ga Zuifua. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Kɛlɛ maamusɛi, ta lɛbiyai, ta ziilɛigi ɠa GALA ka fe naati zea, niiti pɛ ti faa ʋagɔi ɠɛɛzu, Zuifuiti mɔunpa, naa ʋoluma niiti ti la ga Zuifua. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge la ɗa ga zeelɔzɔɠɔzu ɠɛ nuɓusɛiti su.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, niiti ti kotoi ɠɛɛni, ti la ɠɛni dɛ Moize ná-tɔgi ɠwɛɛ, naati undaa ɠa ʋili, tɔgi naa ná-faa la ɠɛa naazu. Kɛlɛ zɔiti ma ti kotoi ɠɛɛzu, tɔgi tɔna kwɛɛgai zu, naati tukpɔ ɠaa ɠa leʋe ga tɔgi naa. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ telebo nui la ga naati GALA gaazu, niiti ti woilosu tɔ gooi ma nɔ, kɛlɛ kɛni zɔiti ti ɠolozu naa ʋɛ, nii é bosu. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Ni zii ɠiligiti, niiti Moize ná-tɔgi la ti ya, naati ta tɔgi zu vaiti seina ɓɔɠɔ ma, naa a ɠɛɛna, kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ tɔgi ɠa ti yiimaʋɛ, anɛɛ ni é la ti ya ɲɛgɛlɛin. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Ta dɛɛzu ga tɔgi ɠɛʋelei zɛʋɛʋɛ ti-yiimaʋɛ, tɔɔzei kɛɛwotii naa ʋa, ti kɛɛzu. Ti-yiimaʋɛ ɠa dɛɛzu ɠana, é ɓɔ ɓalaa ta-ɠisiɛi ʋa, naati ta zoo yeeta ti ti ʋeelala, ɓaa ti ti maalobo. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Naa ɠa a ɠula kɛlɛma naama volo ná, yeei GALA ge tukpɔi ɠaaleʋezu la ga Yesu Kilista maaʋele, é ʋilɛ nuɓusɛiti ta-lɔɔɠuzu vaiti pɛ ba, eɠɛʋelei Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi la, gè daazeelizu.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuifuiti ta tɔgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Kɛlɛ ɗa ʋe, ɗɛi Zuifu laaseigi ʋɛai è ʋa, è ʋoluzeizu tɔgi ʋa, è ɗa waso, tɛi è ga GALA nɔnɔi, <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>ɗɛi è GALA ziimai ɠwɛɛ, tɔgi è ɠalagai ga è faa ʋagɔiti gaaɠa, <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>ɗɛi è ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛzu ga ɗa ɠa è losu gaazuɠole nuiti tuɠɔ, ɗa ɠa è ga kpidi zu nuiti ta-wozakalagi, <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>ɠimalala nuiti pilɛ nui pele ʋa, faaɠwɛtala nuiti ta-ɠalamɔin, tɔɔzei faaɠwɛgi ta gaamai ɠwɛɛ pelei ɠa è ya tɔgi zu, <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>ɗɛi è zɔiti kalasu, leeni vaa zu mu è la ɓɔɠɔ ɠalasu ɗa ɓɔɠɔi? Ɗɛi è tɛnɛgi wosu ga nu maa la nɛɛni, é ʋa unma wo, ɗa unmai wosu! <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Ɗɛi è ɠɛɛzu ma, nu maa la nɛɛni, é ʋa wɛɛnziɛ bo, ɗa wɛɛnziɛgi wosu! Ɗɛi è kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti wɔinzeɠezu, ɗa unmai wosu ti lɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu! <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Ɗɛi è ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛzu su ga tɔgi, ɗa ɓaaɠulazu GALA ma, ga tɔgi ɠoloɠolo fai! <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: «Zii ɠiligiti ta woo ɲɔi wosu GALA daaseigi laalɔɠɔma, é lɔɔzei wo ʋa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Eza 52:5</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tatipɛlɛʋolu ɠitei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Tɔnɔgi ɠa tatipɛlɛʋolu vai ʋa, ni ɗa tɔgi zona. Kɛlɛ ni ɗa tɔgi ɠoloɠolona, toɠa ɠɛ naazu eɠɛ è la latini pɛlɛʋolu. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Ni nui é la latini pɛlɛʋolu, naa a ɠolona tɔgi wooi ʋɛ, GALA ge la naama nui levea ga eɠɛ a lati pɛlɛʋolu? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Nui nii é la latini pɛlɛʋolu kpusɛi zu, kɛlɛ é ɠolozu tɔgi ʋɛ, toɠa è ʋeelala, ɗɛi è kololalai ɠɛɛzu tɔgi ʋɛ, anɛɛ ni tɔgi ma zɛʋɛi ɠa è ya, è latigai pɛlɛʋolu. <verse eid="ROM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Zuifu ɠitei la nɔ ga naa, nii nu kaazu ga ɠaazuʋɛ, ta tatigai pɛlɛʋolu nu ɗa ka nɔ kpusɛi zu. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Zuifu ɠitei ɠa ga naa, nii nɔnɔi ziimaʋɛ, tatipɛlɛʋolui ɠa ga nu yiimaʋɛ vaa, tatipɛlɛʋolui nii é ga GALA Zɛnvui ná-faa, é la nɔ ga sɛʋɛi zu vaa. Zuifu ɠitei naa, nuiti taade ti ʋa ɠɛ maamusɛzu, kɛni GALA ɓɔɠɔi.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="s">Nuɓusɛi pɛ ka ga sɔba nu GALA gaazu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Leeni ɠa é ga Zuifui vizɔsuʋɛ? Tatipɛlɛʋolui ma ɠulanumai ɠa ga ɓɛgele? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Ti vizɔgɛ gola, fai pɛ su. Mɔunpa, Zuifuiti ka GALA daawooi ɠalivaai ti ma. <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Naama leeni ɠa da bo naazu, ni tanigaani ta ti zaama, ti ga wooʋalada nu? Ta-wooʋaladalai ɠa GALA ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠoloɠolo ɓaa? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Naa li poun! Kɛni GALA ge ɠwɛɛ ga gaama ƓALAGI, anɛɛ ni nuɓusɛi pɛ ka levezu ga zɛɛ wo nu, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">«Kɛni ti è ɠwɛɛ ga telebo nu è ɓɔɛ wooiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">ni nu a ɠɛna é è lukpɔ, è pee zɔlɔɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 51:6">Guy 51:6</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Kɛlɛ ni telebotalai de kɛɛzu, naa ɠa kulazu kɛlɛma ga GALA telebogɛ, leeni ɠa da bo? Telebotalai ɠa GALA ge su ɓaa, siɛgi zu a ná-ziiɠaawanai zei la de ma? (Nà ɓɔɛzu ga nuɓusɛiti kpɔɛ ʋelei.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Naa li poun! Mazɔlɔɔ ni GALA ge ɠɛni ga telebotala nu, a la zoo ɠale, é eteai lukpɔɠaaleʋe?<verse eid="ROM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Kɛlɛ ni nà-zɛɛi ɠa GALA ná-gaamai ɠulazu kɛlɛma ga pagɔ, suwɔɔlɔ é ɠɛ bɛ ga lɛbiyai, leeni vaa zu màanɛai mɔnɔ gè ʋeelala eɠɛ kotoba nu? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Naazu leeni vaa zu ada ɠɛ ma mu: «Ade faa ɲɔi ɠɛ, faa ʋagɔi ɗa ɠula su»? Nui tanigaani ta ná, nii a kɛ ti nà-faa ɲɔi wo, ta pèelalazu ga naa ɠɛɠala ɓɔɛiti ka, gè ti wosu. Naama nuiti ta peelalai zɔlɔɔ, tɔɔzei naa ɠa soloogai ti ma.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Telebo nu la ná</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Kɛlɛ leeni ʋe deɠɛmu? Adɛiti de ga Zuifuiti, de vizɔgɛ zii ɠiligiti ba ɓaa? Naa laade, ɲɛgɛlɛin! Gè ɓega ga dɛɛ ga Zuifuiti ta zii ɠiligiti kpein, kotoi ɠa zeini ti pɛ unda. <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">«Telebo nu nɔpɛ ge la ná, anɛɛ gila kpalaa,<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>tanɔpɛ ge la ga faaɠaaɠaa nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">ti tanɔpɛ ge la GALA gaiziɛzu.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Ti pɛ ti ɠakaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">ti kpein ti luʋa ʋelei ɲɔuɗa ʋɔɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">taɠila kpalaa ge la ná, nii é faa ʋagɔ ɠɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">anɛɛ gila kpalaa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10-12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Guy 14:1-3</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>«Ti-ɠɔdayeɠei ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ kabayeɠei daalaogai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">ti-nɛgi ɠa ti-laaʋɛ ga ti ɗa yaavai ɠɛɛ la.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 5:10">Guy 5:10</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">«Kaali wanai ɠa é ɠulazu ti-lakɔlɔgiti bu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 140:4">Guy 140:4</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>«Ti-laaʋɛti daavegɛ ga foovooi ta woo ɲɔi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 10:7">Guy 10:7</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>«Ti-ɠɔɠɔiti maavilɛʋɛ ɲama ʋuu ɓizɛi wosu,<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>faa zuɠoloɠologi ta nimizaiti ta ɗa yɛ ti-ziɛzuʋɛti pɛ,<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>ti la ziilɛi pelei ɠwɛɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15-17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Eza 59:7-8</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>«GALA gaazuluabai la ti ɠaazu ga faa nɔpɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 36:2">Guy 36:2</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Niizu, de kwɛni, de ɠɛ ma, nii tɔgi bosu, toɠa naa wosu naati ma, niiti ti tɔgi wu, naa ɠa a kɛ ɛsɛ pɛ daaɠulu, eteai pɛ ge kwɛɛ ga toɠa ga sɔba nu GALA gaazu. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nuɓusɛ nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛa ga telebo nu GALA gaazu ga tɔgi zo fai maaʋele. Tɔgi ɠa nɔ ga zaɓui, nui kwɛɛ ga é kotoi ɠɛɛʋɛ.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Telebodai zɔlɔɔ fai ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Kɛlɛ niizu, ʋelei nu a ɠɛɛ la ga telebo nu GALA gaazu, naa ɠulaʋɛ kɛlɛma, tɔgi ná-faa la naa zu. Moize ná-tɔgi ta GALA goo wo nuiti ta-zɛʋɛiti ti ma zeele woo woni. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>GALA ka nuɓusɛi pɛ kɛɛzu ɠaazu ga telebo nu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele, Yesu Kilista ma. Toɠa naa ɠɛɛzu naati pɛ bɛ, niiti ti ɠidaaleʋezu Kilista ma, zeeɠaaɠwɛɛzu la nuɓusɛiti ba. <verse eid="ROM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɛsɛ pɛ ge kotoi ɠɛa, ti ʋalaga GALA ná-lɛbiyai ma. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Ti pɛ ti levea ga telebo nu ga ná-zaalai maaʋele, GALA ná-faanɛɛi ɠana é kɛɛni, unmɔɔgi maaʋele ma Yesu Kilista ʋaani la. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Tɔ ɠa GALA ge deveni ga koto gba zalaɠai, naati faa ma, niiti ta ɠidaaleʋe ma ɲamai ma, puai, naa ɠa a kɛ é ná-telebodai lɛ. Kotoiti ti ɠɛɛni kaite, GALA ge naati sala vai yɛni ná, ná-ziilɔɔi maaʋele ma. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>É ɠɛni pɔ ga é ná-telebodai lɛ niima ziɛgi zu, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa pɔ ga é ɠɛ ga telebo nu, ta é naati kɛ ga telebo nu, niiti ti ɠidaaleʋezu Yesu ma.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Ɓɔɠɔ maamusɛ ungi ɠa mini naazu? É la ná ɲɛgɛlɛin. Lee vaa zu? Tɔɔzei tɔgi zo fai la mɔ ga faa wola, kɛni kidaaleʋei nɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gá ɠisiɛzu ga nui ɠa ɠɛ ga telebo nu GALA gaazu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele, naa la ɠɛɛzu ga tɔgi zo fai maaʋele. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Ɓaa mu, GALA ka ga Zuifuiti gila nɔ ta-ƓALAGI ɓaa? É la ga zɔɔma nuɓusɛiti ɓalaa ta-ƓALAGI ɓaa? Gaamazu, toɠa ga zii ɠiligiti ɓalaa tɔnɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Tɔɔzei GALA gila kpe nɔ ɠa é ná. Tɔ ɠa é Zuifuiti kɛɛzu ɠaazu ga telebo nuiti ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele. Zɔiti ti la ga Zuifua, é naati ɓalaa kɛ ga telebo nu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele. <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Da GALA ná-tɔgi zɛbɛi ɠoloɠolosu mu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele ɓaa? Naa li poun! Tɔun, tɔgi ná-zɛbɛ ɠitei ɠa, de feezu zea.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s">Abalaame ná-kidaaleʋei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Lee ɠa da bo mu naazu, Abalaame ná-faa zu, nii é ga gi-mɛmɛwola kpusɛi letemazu? Leeni ɠa é sɔlɔɔni? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Ni Abalaame ɠɛni ga telebo nu GALA gaazu ga ná-kɛɛwotiiti maaʋele, é ti ɠɛɛni, a la zoo wasosu. Kɛlɛ é la zooga wasosu GALA gaazu. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ lee ɠa GALA Sɛʋɛi bosu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:3">«Abalaame laani GALA da, naa leveni bɛ ga telebodai.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Zen 15:6</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nui é botii ɠɛɛzu, naa zalai la ɗa ga leve bɛ ga faanɛɛ ʋe, kɛni kuyei. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi é la botii ɠɛɛzu, kɛni nɔ é ɠidaaleʋe GALA ma, nii é telebodai veezu GALA gaazuluabalala nui ya, naa ná-kidaaleʋei ɠa leve bɛ ga telebodai. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Zekana Davide naama nui ná-undaanɛ vai wosu la, zɔi GALA ge telebodai levezu bɛ, é la ɠitoni ná-kɛɛwotiiti ba.<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>«Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naati, niiti ta-lɔ koloɠologiti maavaayɛgai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">ta-ɠotoiti suvaayɛgai!<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:8">zɔi Maliɠii la ná-kotoi laazu unma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7-8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">Guy 32:1-2</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Naama undaanɛɛi ɠa naati nɔ ʋɛ ɓaa, niiti ti ga Zuifuiti ti latigai pɛlɛʋolu? Ɓaa toɠa naati ɓalaa bɛ, niiti ti la ga Zuifua? De bogɛ ga: «GALA ge Abalaame ná-kidaaleʋei leveni ga telebodai.» <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Siɛgi ɓɛgele zu ɠa naa leveni la bɛ? Siɛgi zu é la ɠɛni dɛ latini la pɛlɛʋolu, ɓaa siɛgi zu é latini da pɛlɛʋolu? Ɓa-o, é la ɠɛni ga tatiga ʋoluma pɛlɛʋolu, kɛlɛ aisa é ʋa lati pɛlɛʋolu. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Abalaame tatipɛlɛʋolui zɔlɔɔni naa ʋoluma ga poogi, zeeʋozɛbai ɠana, GALA ge dɛɛ ga telebo nu ná-kidaaleʋei maaʋele ma, aisa é ʋa lati pɛlɛʋolu. Naa ma, Abalaame ɠɛɛʋɛ ga naati ti-ɠɛɛ, niiti kpein ti ɠidaaleʋezu GALA ma, anɛɛ ni ti la latini pɛlɛʋolu, GALA ge ti leve ga telebo nuiti. <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>Toɠa ɓalaa ga Zuifuiti ti-ɠɛɛ, niiti ti la yeelaani tatipɛlɛʋolu vai letelegi nɔ ma, kɛlɛ ti ziɛzu ga naama ɠidaaleʋei ʋogi, nii é ɠɛni ade-ɠɛɛ Abalaame ya, siɛgi zu é la ɠɛni dɛ latini la pɛlɛʋolu.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-minazeɠegi é zɔlɔɔsu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ eteai zɔlɔɔ fai ga tɔnɔ, GALA ge ma minazeɠegi woni Abalaame ta mavofodaiti bɛ. Naa la ɠɛni woni Abalaame ʋɛ, tɔɔ ʋa zei koloi ʋa, é ɠɛni bosu tɔgi ʋɛ, kɛlɛ tɔɔzei é leveni GALA gaazu ga telebo nui, ga ná-kidaaleʋei maaʋele. <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni tɔgi zo nuiti nɔ ɠa, ta ɠɛ ga pogani zeɠe nuiti, kidaaleʋei ɠɛa ga wafuun faa, GALA ná-minazeɠegi la mɔ ɓena faa nɔpɛ paa. <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Mazɔlɔɔ tɔgi ɠa GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai wuzeɠezu. Kɛlɛ ʋɛ tɔ ge la ná, tɔ koloɠolo ge la miná.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Naa ɠa é ba, kidaaleʋei maaʋele ɠa poganii zɔlɔɔsu da, nii ma minazeɠegi wogai, naa ɠa a kɛ, é ɠɛ ga GALA ná-faanɛɛi, é ɠɛ ga Abalaame mavofodaiti pɛ tɔnɔ. É la nɔ ga naati nɔ, niiti ti tɔgi zosu, kɛlɛ naati ɓalaa, niiti ti ɠidaaleʋeai, eɠɛʋelei Abalaame ɠidaaleʋeni la. Toɠa ga ade pɛ de-ɠɛɛ, <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la GALA Sɛʋɛi zu, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè è ɠɛa ga zii mɔinmɔingaa ti-ɠɛɛ.» Tɔ ɠa é ga de-ɠɛɛ GALA gaazu, nii é ɠidaaleʋeni, GALA nii é zɛnvui veezu gɔvɛiti zea, é aniiti kula kɛlɛma, niiti ti la ɠɛni ná. <verse eid="ROM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Abalaame ɠitoni naa ʋa, nii nu la ɠitoga ba, é ɠidaaleʋeni. Naa maaʋele ma, é ɠɛni ga «zii mɔinmɔingaa ti-ɠɛɛ»,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Zen 15:5</ref></char>.</char></note> eɠɛʋelei GALA ge boni ma la ga: «Zekana è-mavofodaiti tiegɔi a ɠɛ la.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Zen 17:5</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Iɲɔ ge la ɠɛni leʋeni kidaaleʋei zu, é la ɠɛni ɠaazuloni ná-kɛwola wɔlɔlai ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ é maaɓuɠani niina kona ungilagi (100) ʋa, doun zɔlɔɔ fai ɓalaa ɠɛni niina leʋeni anzai Sala ʋa. <verse eid="ROM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>É la ɠɛni ʋalani kidaaleʋei ma, é ʋa inɛinɛ GALA ná-minazeɠegi ʋa, kɛlɛ tɔun ná-kidaaleʋei sɛbɛlɔɔni, é lɛbiyai ve GALA bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>É laani da kpezekele ga zobo ka GALA bɛ, minazeɠegi é bogai, é daazeeli. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Naa ɠa é ba, naa leveni bɛ ga telebodai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Zen 15:6</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Kɛlɛ wooi nii é ga: «É leveni bɛ ga telebodai», naa la nɔ zɛʋɛni GALA Sɛʋɛi zu tɔ ɠila bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>Sɛʋɛʋɛ ada ɓalaagi ade ʋɛ, dɛiti de ɠidaaleʋea naa ma, nii é zɛnvui ʋuuni de-Maliɠii Yesu zu, é buzeɠe, é kula saai ya. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>É saai zɔlɔɔni ada-vaaɠaazagiti faa zu, é wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya, é de ɠɛ ga telebo nu GALA gaazu.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ziilɛigi é de yɔɠɔzu da GALA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Naa ɠa é ba, tɛi de ɠɛa ga telebo nuiti GALA gaazu, kidaaleʋei maaʋele ma, ziilɛigi ɠa niina de yɔɠɔzu da GALA, ga de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista maaʋele. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Tɔun maaʋele ma, ade lɔɔzu zɔlɔɔga GALA ná-zaalai zu kidaaleʋei zaɓui zu, nii de zei ʋele ɓɛtɛai niina su. Nii é koozunɛɛi veezu ade ya, naa ɠa ga kitogi, ga de dɔnɔ zɔlɔɔga GALA ná-lɛbiyai zu. <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>É ɓudɛ naa maazu, da ɠoozunɛɛzu da-ɓɔlɔiti su, mazɔlɔɔ de kwɛɛ ga kpɔlɔi ɠa a ɗa ʋa ga ziilɔɔi, <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>ziilɔɔi ʋa ga wooɠɛɠiladai poluɠulazu la ba, wooɠɛɠiladai poluɠulazu la ba, naa ʋa ga kitogi. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Kitogi naa la ɗa ga nu iɲɔteʋea, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge ná-nɛɛbɛi lɔa ade-yiimaʋɛti ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai, nii é feai ade ya.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Tama siɛgi zu zɛbɛ la ɠɛni dɛ de ya la, Kilista zaani GALA gaazuluabalala nuiti ade ʋɛ, yeeɠɛɠalai zu é leveni la GALA bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nui a zoo é za telebo nui ʋɛ, naama nui zɔlɔɔ fai ɓaaʋɛ gola, tanisu ta ɠa yiilɔɔ, é za nu ʋagɔi ʋɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge ná-nɛɛbɛi lɛɛʋɛ ga adeye ga nii, naa ɠa ga Kilista zaani ade ʋɛ, siɛgi zu ade ɠɛni la dɛ ga kotoba nuiti. <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Ade ɠɛa ga telebo nuiti GALA gaazu ma ɲamai maaʋele ma, é ɓudɛ naa maazu, niizu tɔun saala zu, da ɠizo ɓalaa GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai ma. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Ade ɠɛni ga GALA sili nuiti, kɛlɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔ ɠa é ade yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛa ga ná-Doun Zunui zaa vai maaʋele. É ɓudɛ naa maazu, niizu ade yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛai niina ada tɔun, ná-Doun Zunui yɛnvui maaʋele ɠa da ɠizo da. <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Naa ʋoluma mɔnɔ, GALA ka ade ɠoozunɛɛzu ga ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista maaʋele, nii é ade yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛai niina ada GALA.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adama ta Yesu Kilista</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, kotoi lɔɔni eteai zu ga nu ɠila kpegi maaʋele, Adama, saai ʋa ga kotoi maaʋele, saai zeelia ɛsɛ pɛ ma, tɔɔzei ɛsɛ pɛ ge kotoi ɠɛa. <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Tama aisa GALA ge ʋa tɔgi ve Moize ya, kotoi ɠɛni niina eteai zu, kɛlɛ kotoi la ɠɛni dɛ levezu, siɛgi zu tɔgi la ɠɛni ná la. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, saai masadai ɠɛɛni, é zo Adama ná-yeeɠɛɠalai ma, é zeeli Moize nɔnɔi ma, é zeeli vɔlɔ naama nuiti pɛ ma, niiti ti la ɠɛni kotoi ɠɛɛni ga Adama ná-tɔ koloɠologi ɠɛɠala. Adama ɠɛni ga naa ná-poogi, nii é ʋaazu.<verse eid="ROM 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Kɛlɛ zɔɠɔzu ɠa Adama ná-faaɠaazagi ta GALA ná-vebɛanii ʋa, nii sɔngɔ ve la ba. Ma mɔinmɔin ge zaa nu ɠilagi ná-faaɠaazagi maaʋele ma, kɛlɛ GALA ná-zaalai wɔɔlɔʋɛ gola, ta vebɛanii é feezu ga faanɛɛi ma mɔinmɔin bɛ, nu ɠilagi maaʋele ma, nii é ga Yesu Kilista. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Zeeɠaaɠwɛɛzu ɠa nu ɠilagi ná-kotoi ma zalai ʋa ta GALA ná-vebɛanii, nii sɔngɔ ve la ba! Tɔɔzei nu ɠilagi ná-faaɠaazagi ʋoluma, tukpɔi ʋaani ga peelalai, kɛlɛ faaɠaaza mɔinmɔin poluma, GALA ná-vebɛanii ʋaani ga telebodai. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Ni nu ɠilagi ná-faaɠaazagi maaʋele ɠa é kɛa saai masadai ɠɛa, deɠɛmu, zɔiti ti zaalai zɔlɔɔsu, é mɔin ti ma, ta vebɛanii nii é ga telebodai, naati ta ɓudɛ naa maazu poun, ti zɛnvui wo, ti masadai ɠɛ Yesu Kilista maaʋele ma.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ʋelei peelalai nui pɛ soga da, nu ɠila kpegi ná-faaɠaazagi maaʋele ma, zekana ɓalaa nu ɠila kpegi ná-telebo kɛɛwotii maaʋele ma, nii é ga Yesu Kilista, nuɓusɛiti ta ɠɛɛ la ga telebo nu GALA gaazu, é zɛnvui ve ɛsɛ pɛ zea. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Mazɔlɔɔ eɠɛʋelei ma mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛa la ga kotoba nu, nu ɠila kpegi ná-woozotalai maaʋele ma, zekana nɔ, ma mɔinmɔin ka ɠɛɛ la GALA gaazu ga telebo nu, nu ɠila kpegi ná-woozogi maaʋele ma. <verse eid="ROM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Tɔgi ʋaani, naazu ɠa kotoi mɔinɗa la, kɛlɛ ʋɛ kotoi mɔinɗai ná, zaalai mɔinɗa miná gola, é ɓudɛ maazu. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Nii a kɛ, eɠɛʋelei kotoi masadai ɠɛa la ga saai maaʋele, zenɔ ɠana, zaalai a masadai ɠɛɛ la ɠana nɔ ga telebodai maaʋele, é li ga deye ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui ʋɔ bɛ, de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista zaɓui zu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s">Zaalai ɠa ɗa nu ɠula kotoi ná-duɔlai zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Lee ɠa da bo mu naazu? De maanɛɛʋɛ de ɗa eteai ziɛ kotoi ɠɛai zu, naa ɠa a kɛ GALA ná-zaalai zuwɔɔlɔ gola ɓaa? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Tɔun naa li poun! Adɛiti de zaa ga de ɓeteʋe kotoi ʋa, da da-eteai ziɛzu mɔnɔ ɠale kotoi ɠɛɛ vai zu? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Wo la suɠwɛɛ ɓaa, ga adɛiti kpein de ɓatizegai Yesu Kilista ná-gilibalai zu, ná-saai ma ɠilibalai zu ɠa de ɓatizegai ná? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Ɓatizei maaʋele ma deɠɛmu, ade maaɠuluni ada tɔun, tɛi ade zaani ada tɔun, naa ɠa a kɛ, ʋelei Kilista wuzeɠeni la, é ɠula saai ya, Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA ná-lɛbiyai ma zɛbɛi zaɓui zu, da ɓalaagi de eteai ziɛ zɛnvu niinɛlai zu.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni ade ɠɛa ga ani ɠila ada tɔun, ga ná-saai ma zii ɠɛʋele, ada ɠɛ ga ani ɠila ga ná-buzeɠei ma zii ɠɛʋele. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>De kwɛni de ɠɛ, de ɠɛʋele wɔlɔmai, naati ta Kilista ti ɓadɔni saa wului ma ʋɔɔma, naa ɠa a kɛ, kotoba ɓusɛi ɠoloɠolo, de mina mɔ ɠɛ ga kotoi ná-duɔiti. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔi saai, naa la mɔ duɔla zu kotoi ya. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Ni de zaani ʋɔɔma da Kilista, de laaʋɛ da ga da zɛnvui wo ɓalaa ʋɔɔma da tɔun. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Ade suɠwɛɛ ga Kilista, nii buzeɠeai, é ɠula saai ya, é la mɔ zaa ʋolu, saai ná-zobo nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ma ɲɛgɛlɛin. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ saai naa é boni, é zaani kotoi ma vaa zu, ná ɠɛ ɠila kpe, é ɠwɛ naa ʋa, kɛlɛ zɛnvui é bosu niina, toɠa bosu GALA bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Zenɔ ɠana wa ɓalaagi, à ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛtɛ ga wo za, wo ɓeteʋe kotoi ʋa, wa niina vulua GALA bɛ, wa-ɠilibalai zu wa Yesu Kilista.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Kotoi maa la mɔ nɛɛni, é ʋa zei wo-ɓusɛi unda, é ga saa gelei, ga wo ʋa ɗa ɠolo kpusɛi naa yiima vaiti bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>À mina wo-ɓusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛti fe kotoi ya ga telebotalai ɠɛɛ zɔɔlaiti. Kɛlɛ à ɓɔɠɔ ve GALA bɛ ga nuɓusɛiti, niiti ti vuluai su, ti ɠula saai ya, wo ɓɔɠɔ ve mɛtu ga telebodai ɠɛɛ zɔɔlaiti. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kotoi la zeiɗa wo unda, tɔɔzei wo la tɔ bu, kɛlɛ kɛni GALA ná-zaalai.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Telebodai ná-duɔiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Leeni ʋe mu? Da yɛ kotoi ɠɛɛzu, tɛi de la tɔ bu, kɛni GALA ná-zaalai? Ɓa-o, naa li poun! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Wo kwɛni kpezekele ga ni wa ɓɔɠɔ veena nu ya, wo ɗa boti ɠɛ bɛ, wo ɠolo bɛ, wo ɠɛa ga naa ná-duɔi, nii wo ɠolozu bɛ, é ɠɛni ga kotoi ʋe, nii gaaɓelagi ga saai, ɓaa ni GALA gooi zo fai ʋe, naa ɠaaɓelazuʋɛ ɠa ga telebogi. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Kɛlɛ mamagi ɠɛ GALA bɛ, wɔiti mɔungi zu wo ɠɛni ga kotoi ná-duɔiti, wo ɠoloa niina ga wo-yiimaʋɛ pɛ naama vaiti bɛ, ti kalagi zu, wo sɔlɔɔni. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Tama wo ɠulaa kotoi ná-duɔlai zu, wo ɠɛ ga telebodai ná-duɔiti. <verse eid="ROM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Ʋelei nuɓusɛi a ɓɔɛ la, ʋele ɠana gè ɓɔɛzu la, tɔɔzei wo-ɓusɛi ná-zɛbɛsulalai ʋa. Ʋelei mɔungi, wo wo-ɓusɛi pɛ dɔɔni la duɔlai zu, é ɠɛ ga kɔzɔba vai ta tɔ koloɠolo fai, ga wo ɗa eteai ziɛ tɔ koloɠologi zu, niizu à ɓɔɠɔ ve lɛɛ ɠana eɠɛ duɔiti, wo ɠɛ ga telebodai ɠɛ nuiti, ga wo eteai ziɛ ɲadedai zu.<verse eid="ROM 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Mazɔlɔɔ siɛgi zu wo ɠɛni la ga kotoi ná-duɔiti, wo vieni, faa la ɠɛni wo ʋa telebodai letemazu. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Lee ma ɠulanuma ɠa wo sɔlɔɔni naama ɠɛɛwotiiti ba, niiti wo unfesu ga tiye niizu? Naama ɠɛɛwotiiti gaaɓelazuʋɛ ɠa ga saai! <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Kɛlɛ niizu, tɛi wo ɠula kotoi ná-duɔlai zu, wo ɠɛ ga GALA ná-duɔiti, kulanumai wo sɔlɔɔsu, naa ɠa é ga ɲadedai, nii wo ʋaazu sɔlɔɔsu gaaɓelagi, naa ɠa é ga ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kotoi ma zalai ɠa é ga saai, kɛlɛ GALA ná-vebɛanii, nii sɔngɔ ve la ba, naa ɠa é ga ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui, da-ɠilibalai zu da de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s">Kidaaleʋe nuiti ti viega, <optbreak/> ti ɠula tɔgi wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Nà ɓɔɛzu naati pɔ, niiti ti tɔgi ɠwɛɛ ga pagɔ. Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wo la kwɛni ɓaa, ga tɔgi ɠa zeini nui unda, ni nɔ dɛ toɠa vulua? <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Zenɔ ɠana é la, anzanui fuluai, giliʋɛ sinigi ʋa tɔgi ya, ni naa ɠa dɛ vulua. Kɛlɛ sinigi a zaana, é viega, é ɠula sinigi ná-tɔgi wu. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ni sinigi la dɛ zaani, a zeina zunu ɠili bɛ, toɠa loli ga wɛɛnziɛ anzanui. Kɛlɛ ni sinigi a zaana, é viega, é la mɔ naa ná-tɔgi wu, toɠa zoo naazu é ɠɛ ga zunu ɠili anza, é la loliga ga wɛɛnziɛ anzanu.<verse eid="ROM 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Zekana é la wo letema, kɛ̀ɛleaiti. Wo zaa, wo ɓeteʋe tɔgi ʋa, wo ɠili vai zu Kilista ɓusɛi ʋa, ga wo ɠɛ ga taɠili nɔnɔ. Niizu wa niina ga naa nɔnɔiti, nii é zaani, é wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya, naa ɠa a kɛ, de kɛɛwotiiti kɛ, kulanuma ɠɛ ba GALA bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ siɛgi zu de ɠɛni zɛnvui wosu la ga kpusɛi yiimai, kotoi ɠɛɛ wɔin nii tɔgi ɠɛni de liizu ma, naa ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu de-ɓusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛ pɛ su, ma ɠulanumai ɠɛ ga é de lɔ saai zu. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Kɛlɛ niizu, de viega, de ɠula tɔgi wu, mazɔlɔɔ de zaa, de ɠula naa ya, nii é de zoni ga duɔi. Naa ma, da zoo niina de botii ɠɛ GALA bɛ ga pagɔ, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-zobogi wu, naa la mɔ ɠɛɛzu kɛʋele wɔlɔmai ma, ga tɔ sɛʋɛi ná-zobogi wu.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi ta kotoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Lee ɠa da bo mu naazu? Tɔgi ɠa ga koto? Ɓa-o, naa li poun! Kɛlɛ gè la ɠɛni kotoi ɠwɛɛga, ni tɔgi laade. Gè la ɠɛni gaazuɠulapɔi ɠwɛɛga, ni tɔgi la ɠɛni ɠɛɛni ma: «Mina gaazuɠulapɔ ɠɛ.» <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Kɛlɛ kotoi yeeɠɛɠalai zɔlɔɔni ga devei maaʋele, é gaazuɠulapɔ ɲɔi ma zii pɛ pu nɔ̀un su. Mazɔlɔɔ ni tɔ ge la ná, koto la ná. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Tɔ ge la ɠɛni dɛ ná, nɔ̀un gè ɠɛni vulua názuʋɛ. Kɛlɛ devei ʋaai ma, kotoi yɛnvuni, <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>nɔ̀un gè zaani. Naa ɠa é ba, devei nii mugi a la lo nu luɠɔ zɛnvui wo fai zu, naa ɠɛɛʋɛ nɔ̀un bɛ ga saai. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kotoi yeeɠɛɠalai zɔlɔɔni ga devei maaʋele, é yàavani, é pàa ga devei naa nɔ maaʋele.<verse eid="ROM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, tɔgi ɲadegɛ, devei ɲadegɛ, é zɔle, é ʋa. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Nii pagai, naa ɠɛa nɔ̀un bɛ ga saai ma zaɓui ɓaa? Ɓa-o, naa li poun! Kotoi ɠa kɛai ga ma zaɓui. Ʋele ɠana é ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛʋele ɠiteɠitegi ɠulaai la kɛlɛma: Nii pagai, naa ɠa é seɠeai, é kɛ ga nɔ̀un saa zaɓui. Ʋele ɠana kotoi ɠɛa la, devei maaʋele ma, ga kotoi ɲɔuɗai gola.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nui kotoi zeini unda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>De kwɛni, de ɠɛ, tɔgi ɠa ga zɛnvu zu vaa, kɛlɛ nɔ̀un nà ga kpusɛ zu nui, zɛbɛ la bà, pɔ̀diʋɛ ga duɔi kotoi ma. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nii gè kɛɛzu, gè la naa ɠaaɠaazu. Nii gè pɔ ga gè kɛ, gè la naa ɠɛɛzu. Nii mugi gè wɔinzeɠezu, naa ɠa gè kɛɛzu. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Ni nii gè la pɔ, gè ʋa kɛ, nà naa ɠɛɛna, gè zolooga ma naazu ga tɔgi ʋagɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Naazu nà la mɔ de, gè ʋa ɠɛ naa ɠɛɛzu, kɛlɛ kɛni kotoi é zeini zìimaʋɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Gè kwɛni ga faa ʋagɔ la zeini zìimaʋɛ, kpùsɛi zu. Mazɔlɔɔ wɔin ɠa mà ga gè faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ, kɛlɛ ma zobo ge la bɛ̀, gè ʋa kɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Mazɔlɔɔ faa ʋagɔi gè pɔ ga gè kɛ, gè la naa ɠɛɛzu, kɛlɛ faa ɲɔi mugi wɔin la mà ga gè kɛ, naa ɠa gè kɛɛzu. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Ni nii gè la pɔ ga gè ʋa kɛ, nà naa ɠɛɛzu, nà la mɔ ga naa gè ʋa ɠɛ kɛɛzu, kɛni kotoi é zeini zìimaʋɛ, naa ʋe.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Nà kaazu naazu ga toɠa mà eɠɛ tɔ ga siɛgi zu gè pɔ ga gè faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ la, faa ɲɔi ɠa ɠatasu nɔ̀un ba. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ná-tɔgi nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀ zìimaʋɛ, <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>kɛlɛ nà tɔgi taɠili kaazu ɓusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛti, nii é nà-kisiɛi ná-tɔgi zakpesu. Naa ɠa kɛ̀ɛzu ga kotoi ná-duɔi, é kpùsɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛti. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Ee, màawɔinɗa! Ɓɛ ɠa a fìe, é kùla kpusɛi nii ya, é dɔ̀ɔzu saai zu? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Mamagi ɠa GALA bɛ: Toɠa naa ɠɛ de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista zaalai zu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Naa ɠa é ba, nà ga GALA ná-tɔgi ma luɔi nà-kisiɛi zu, kɛlɛ nà ga kotoi ná-tɔgi ma luɔi kpùsɛi zu.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s">Zɛnvu Ɲadegai é zɛnvui veezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Deɠɛmu niizu, peelala vaa nɔpɛ ge la mɔ naati ba, niiti ti ɠiliai Yesu Kilista ʋa. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-tɔgi, nii é zɛnvui veezu nui ya, a ɠili Yesu Kilista ʋa, naa è viega,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">naa è viega</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠiligaa ɓalaa ka ga niiti: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">naa fìega </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɓaa </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">naa gi viega</char></note> é è ɠula kotoi ta saai ta-lɔgi ya. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nii Moize ná-tɔgi la ɓena zoo é ʋa kɛ, tɔɔzei kpusɛi kɛɛni ga zɛbɛsulala ani, GALA ge naa ɠɛɛni. GALA ge kotoi ʋeelalani kpusɛi zu, ná-Doun Zunui leʋe fai zu, é ɠula ga kotoba ɓusɛi ɠɛʋelei, é kotoi zeɠe ná. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>GALA ge naa ɠɛɛni ga tɔgi ma lelebodai laazeeli ade ʋɛ, dɛiti de la mɔ ziɛzu ga kpusɛi yiimai, kɛlɛ kɛni Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yiimai.<verse eid="ROM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Tɔɔzei niiti ti ziɛzu ga ti-ɓusɛi yiimai, naati ta ɗa ɠaaɓa kpusɛi yiimaiti nɔ ma, kɛlɛ niiti ti ziɛzu ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yiimai, naati ta ɗa ɠaaɓa naa nɔ ma, nii Zɛnvui bosu ti ma. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Ni ɗa ɠaaɓaana è-ɓusɛi yiimaiti nɔ ma, naa ɠaaɠaaɓela ga saai, kɛlɛ ni ɗa ɠaaɓaana Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yiimai ma, naa ɠa é ga zɛnvui ta ziilɛigi. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kpusɛi yiimaiti ta GALA daalɔɠɔma, tɔɔzei kpusɛi la ɠoloa GALA ná-tɔgi ʋɛ, é la vɔlɔ ziaa naa wu pɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Tama niiti ti ɠiliai ti-ɓusɛi yiimaiti ba, naati ti la zooga ti ʋa GALA ɛnɛkɛ.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Kɛlɛ wɔun, wo la mɔ eteai ziɛzu ga wo-ɓusɛi yiimaiti, wa niina eteai ziɛzu ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yiimai, tɔɔzei GALA Zɛnvui ɠa zeini wo-yiimaʋɛ. Zɔi nɔpɛ Kilista ná-zɛnvui la zea, naa la ga tɔun nɔnɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Tama ni Kilista ɠa wo-yiimaʋɛ, naazu anɛɛ ni deveʋɛ ga wo-ɓusɛi za kotoi maaʋele ma, kɛlɛ Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠa zɛnvui wo wo-yiimaʋɛ, tɔɔzei wo ɠɛa ga telebo nuiti GALA gaazu. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>GALA, nii é Yesu wuzeɠeni, é kula saai ya, ni naa ná-Zɛnvui ɠa zeini wo-yiimaʋɛ, naazu zɔi é Yesu Kilista wuzeɠeni, é kula saai ya, naa ɠa zɛnvui ve ɓalaa wo-ɓusɛiti zea, ti ga saa gelei, ná-Zɛnvui zaalai zu, nii é zeini wo-yiimaʋɛ.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, kuye ɠa ade ma, kɛlɛ kpusɛi letema laade, de ʋa eteai ziɛ mɔnɔ ga kpusɛi yiimaiti kɛʋelei. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Ni wa eteai ziɛna kpusɛi yiimai zu, wa za. Kɛlɛ ni wa wo-ɓusɛi ná-kɛɛwotiiti paana, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɛbɛi zu, wa zɛnvui wo. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔiti kpein GALA Zɛnvui losu ti luɠɔ, naati ta ga GALA dointi. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Zɛnvui wo sɔlɔɔgai, é la ga zɛnvui é wo ɠɛɛzu ga duɔiti, wo ʋa ɠɛ dɛ dualuagi zu, kɛlɛ Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ʋe, é wo ɠɛɛzu ga GALA dointi, é ma zobogi ve de ʋɛ, de ɗa wooɠula GALA ma ga: «Aɓa!», naa ɠa ga «Kɛ̀ɛ!» <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>GALA Zɛnvui ɓɔɠɔi ɠa kolezu de-yɛnvui ʋɛ ga da ga GALA dointi. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Tɔɔzei da ga ná-dointi, da ɓalaa ga pogani zeɠe nuiti, GALA ná-pogani zeɠe nuiti, ada Kilista ade ɠɛa ga pogani zeɠe nuiti ʋɔɔma, ni da ʋɔɔpɛɛna ná-kpɔlɔi ʋa, da ʋɔɔpɛɛ ɓalaa ná-lɛbiyai ʋa.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lɛbiyai é ʋaazu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Nà ɠisiɛzu ga, maa la nɛɛni kpɔlɔi de sɔlɔɔsu niizuʋɛ, de ʋa naa ʋokɔɠɔ lɛbiyai ma, é ʋaazu ɠulazu kɛlɛma ade ʋɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kpɛtɛanii pɛ ka maaɓɔungi wosu kitogi zu ga GALA dointi ta-ɠula kɛlɛma yeei zeelina. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kpɛtɛaniiti ziima la ɠɛni ɠɛɛni ga ti lɔɔ vai wafuun fai zu, kɛlɛ kɛni naa yiimai maaʋele ma, nii é ti lɔɔni naa zu. Kɛlɛ kitogi ɠa ná, <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>ga kpɛtɛanii naati ɓɔɠɔi ta unmɔɔgi zɔlɔɔ, ti ɠula duula vai ma luɔlai zu, ti tɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ GALA dointi ta-wɔɔlɔyai ta ta-lɛbiyai zu. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Tama de suɠwɛɛ ga kpɛtɛanii pɛ ka ɓalasu eɠɛ ta ɠɛ doun zɔlɔɔ taɓai zu, é zeeli za ma. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Kɛlɛ kpɛtɛaniiti gila nɔ laade, dɛi de Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɔlɔɔgai na ga GALA ná-vebɛaniiti ma mɔungi, da ɓalasu ɠoozu da ɓɔɠɔi, de ɗa naa maaɓɔun ga GALA ge ʋa ade ɠɛ ga ná-doun zunuiti, é de-ɓusɛi unmɔɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Tɔɔzei ade ɠizogɛ ga kitogi maaʋele. Kɛlɛ kitogi nii nu kaazu, kito ge la mɔ ga naa, mazɔlɔɔ nii nu kaazu, ɗa ɠito naa ʋa ɠale mɔnɔ? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Kɛlɛ ni da ɠitosu naa ʋa, nii de la dɛ kaani, da maaɓɔunsu ziilɔɔi zu.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Zenɔ ɠana ɓalaa é la, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠa ɗa ʋa, é ɓɔ de ʋa, da-zɛbɛsulalai zu. Mazɔlɔɔ de la naa ɠwɛɛ, nii soloogai ga de fali da-ƓALA falii zu. Kɛlɛ Zɛnvui ɓɔɠɔi ɠa maanɛɛnɛi wosu ade ʋɛ, é ɗa kpalagi wo, nii nu la zooga a ʋa ti pɛ suɠula. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>GALA é nu yiimaʋɛ ʋɛtɛsu, é naa ɠwɛɛ, nii Zɛnvu Ɲadegai pɔ é fali, mazɔlɔɔ Zɛnvui ɠa maanɛɛnɛi wosu GALA ná-nuiti ta-vaa zu, eɠɛʋelei GALA ziimai la.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>De kwɛni de ɠɛ, GALA ka botii ɠɛɛzu fai pɛ su, é ɠɛ ga faa ʋagɔ naati bɛ, niiti ti nɛa ʋɛ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">GALA ka botii ɠɛɛzu fai pɛ su, é ɠɛ ga faa ʋagɔ naati bɛ, niiti ti nɛa ʋɛ</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠiligaa ɓalaa ka ga niiti: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">fai pɛ ka botii ɠɛɛzu ʋɔɔma, é ɠɛ ga faa ʋagɔ naati bɛ, niiti ti GALA nɛai ʋɛ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɓaa </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Zɛnvui ɠa botii ɠɛɛzu fai pɛ su é ɠɛ ga faa ʋagɔ naati bɛ, niiti ti GALA nɛai ʋɛ</char></note> ti loligai eɠɛʋelei ná-devei la. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Mazɔlɔɔ niiti GALA ge yiimazeɠeni ga tiye ná luɠɔ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">niiti GALA ge yiimazeɠeni ga tiye ná luɠɔ</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">niiti GALA ge ti ɠwɛɛgai ma yeeluɠɔ</char></note> é deveni ná luɠɔ ga é ti ɠula ga ná-Doun Zunui, naa ɠa a kɛ ná-Doun Zunui ɠɛ ga doun mɔungi ɠɛɛɠɛloun mɔinmɔin saama. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Niiti GALA ge naama levei woni ta-vaa zu ná luɠɔ, é naati tolini. Niiti é ti lolini, é naati kɛɛni ɠaazu ga telebo nuiti. Niiti é ti ɠɛɛni ga telebo nuiti, é tɔnɔ veeni ɓalaa ná-lɛbiyai zu.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Lee ɠa da bo mu niima vaiti su? Ni GALA ka de ʋɛ, ɓɛ ɠa a ɠɛ de laalɔɠɔma? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Tɛigi é la ɠɛni ɓaani ná-Doun Zunui maazu, kɛlɛ é feeni ade pɛ da-vaa zu, é la anii pɛ kpɔga naa ʋa, é ʋa fe ade ʋɛ ga faanɛɛ ɓaa? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Nuiti GALA ge yiimazeɠeai ga tiye, ɓɛ ɠa é naati peelalazu? GALA ɓɔɠɔi ɠa é ti ɠɛa ga telebo nuiti! <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a ti ʋeelala? Nu nɔpɛ! Mazɔlɔɔ Yesu Kilista nii é zaani, é wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya, toɠa GALA zeezazuʋɛ, é ɗa de maavaawo. <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é de ɓeteʋe Kilista ná-nɛɛbɛi ʋa? Kpɔlɔi ɓaa, ɓaa kidaaʋiligi, ɓaa wɔinzeɠemai, ɓaa pului, ɓaa baladai, ɓaa faaɓaagi, ɓaa boɠa zɔkpɔi? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">«È maaʋele ɠa é kɛɛzu, ti gi lɔɔzu la saai zu folo-o-folo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">ti ɗa gi leve ga baalagiti, ti liizu ga tiye ti-ʋaazuʋɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 44:23">Guy 44:23</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Kɛlɛ naa pɛ su, ada-vɔnifaamai lateʋegɛ ga naama nui maaʋele, nii é ade nɛai ʋɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Mazɔlɔɔ dàaʋɛ da ga faa nɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa de ɓeteʋe ná-nɛɛbɛi ʋa: anɛɛ saai, ɓaa zɛnvui, ɓaa geezuɠeelaiti, ɓaa kundiɠilaiti, ɓaa niizu vaiti, ɓaa fai niiti ti ʋaazu, ɓaa zobodaiti, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>ɓaa geezu aniiti, ɓaa buu ʋele aniiti, ɓaa anɛɛ kpɛtɛanii tanɔpɛ, faa nɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa de ɓeteʋe GALA ná-nɛɛbɛi ʋa, kulaai kɛlɛma ga de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista maaʋele.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ge yiimazeɠe vai ga Izilayɛle nuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Nii gè bosu, gaamai ʋe, gè la zɛɛ wosu, mazɔlɔɔ nà ga Kilista nɔnɔ. Nà-kisiɛi ɠa ɓɔɛzu pɔ̀, ti zoloogai ma ta Zɛnvu Ɲadegai, <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>zìiɓɔlɔʋɛ gola, ziizoolɛi ɠɛ zìimaʋɛ yeenɔpɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ a la nɛɛ bɛ̀, nà ɓɔɠɔi ga gè ɠoto, kpè ge leʋe Kilista ʋa kɛ̀ɛleaiti ta-vaa zu, ti ga nà-nuiti kpusɛi maaʋele ma, <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>niiti ti ga Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti. GALA ge ti ɠɛai ga ná-doun zunuiti, é lɛbiyai veai ti ʋɛ, ta minazeɠegiti, naa ʋɛɛ tɔgi ta GALA dɛbi ʋelei ʋa, é ɓɔ minazeɠegiti ba, <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>ti ga ɠɛɛɠɛ wolaiti fofodaiti, tiya ɠa Kilista ɠulaai ti zu kpusɛi letemazu. Tɔ ɠa é anii pɛ unga, mamagi ɠa GALA bɛ, eyɛsu ɠɔ. Amina! <verse eid="ROM 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>De ɠɛ GALA daawooi la ga faa, naa laade. Tɔɔzei nii pɛgi é ga Izilayɛle mavofodai, naati pɛ ti la ga Izilayɛle nuɓusɛ ɠiteɠite. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>Abalaame mavofodaiti pɛ tɛi ti ʋa ɠɛ ga ná-doun ɠiteiti. GALA ge ɠɛni Abalaame ma: «Izaake ɠa è-mavofodai a ɠula su.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Zen 21:12</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Naa ʋoluʋɛ ɠa ga, kpusɛi zu lointi tɛi, ti ʋa ɠɛ ga GALA dointi, kɛni minazeɠe dointi, naati ka ti levezu ga mavofoda ɠiteiti. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Minazeɠe kpɔɛi ɠa é ga nii, é ɠɛni ma: «Nà ʋaazu niima yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ ma, Sala ɠa doun zunu zɔlɔɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Zen 18:10</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Kwɛgi la ga naa nɔ. Eleɓɛka yoogiti sɔlɔɔni ɠɛɛɠɛ ɠila kpegi ʋa, nii é ga ade-mɛmɛwola Izaake. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Doungoiti ti la ɠɛni dɛ zɔlɔɔni, ti ʋa faa ʋagɔ ɠɛ, ɓaa faa ɲɔu, kɛlɛ nii a kɛ GALA ná-devei yɛ laazuʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei ziimazeɠegi la, <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>é la ɠilini kɛɛwotiiti ba, kɛlɛ é naa yeezu, nii é toligi woga, é woni Eleɓɛka ma ga: «Nu ɠitei ɠa lɔ loungoi yeezu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Zen 25:23</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>Sɛʋɛʋɛ ɠani GALA Sɛʋɛi zu: «Gè yiimazeɠeʋɛ ga Zakɔɓe, gè Ezawu likpi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 1:2-3">Mal 1:2-3</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Lee ɠa da bo mu naazu? Telebotalai ɠa GALA ge su ɓaa? Ɓa-o, naa li poun! <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Mazɔlɔɔ é ɠɛni Moize ma: «Nà gaazumaawɔinɠai ɠɛ naa ʋɛ, nii gè pɔ gè gaazumaawɔinɠai ɠɛ bɛ. Nà maawɔinɠai ɠɛ naa ʋɛ, nii gè pɔ gè maawɔinɠai ɠɛ bɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Ɛgz 33:19</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nui yiima vaa laade a kɛ, ɓaa ná-gaaɓaai, kɛlɛ kɛni GALA ɓɔɠɔgoi é gaazumaawɔinɠai ɠɛɛzu. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>GALA Sɛʋɛi zu, GALA ge ɠɛni masagi Falaɠɔn ma: «Niima vai maaʋele ɠa é kɛa, gè è zeiɗai masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, naa ɠa a kɛ gè sɛ̀bɛi lɛ ga è maaʋele, dàaseigi wo eteai zu ná pɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Ɛgz 9:16</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Naa ɠa é ba, GALA ka naa ɠaazumaawɔinɠa, zɔi é pɔ é gaazumaawɔinɠa. É naa ɠigi ɓaa, zɔi é pɔ é kigi ɓaa.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai ta ná-gaazumaawɔinɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Ɗa ɠɛ mà tanisu: «Ni zekana é la, lee yeli ɠa GALA ge tosu nuɓusɛiti ma mu? Mazɔlɔɔ ɓɛ ɠa a ɠɛlɛ ziimai ʋa?» <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Kɛlɛ ɓɛ ɠa è ga ɗe, ɗɛi è ga nuɓusɛi, è ʋa GALA sakpe? Pɔlɔ aniɲakai ɠa zoo nɛi ɓaa, é ɠɛ kpɛtɛ nui ma: «Leeni vaa zu è kpɛ̀tɛai ɠani?» <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Zobo ge la pɔlɔ liɠi lo nui ya ɓaa, é ʋa pɔlɔ ɠaayɔgai ta ɓɛtɛ ga diɠi ʋagɔ wolai, é ma pɔlɔ ɠaayɔgai ta nɔ zeɠe, é kpɛtɛ ga diɠii ta nɔ?<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Tama, GALA ge ɠɛni pɔ ga é ná-ziiɠaawanai lɛ, é ná-zobogi ɠula kɛlɛma. Anɛɛ naa ʋe, é yiilɔɔni, é maaɓɔungi wo gola, naati ta-vaa zu, niiti ziiɠaawana ɠasɔi ɠɛni niina ti unma, undaaʋiligi zoloogai ti ma. <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>É ɠɛni pɔ é ná-lɛbiyai wɔɔlɔ ʋelei lɛ ga naati, é ti ɠaazumaawɔinɠa, é ti ɓɛtɛai pɔlɔma ga ti tɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ ná-lɛbiyai zu. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Da ɠa é de loligai, é la nɔ ga de ɠula Zuifuiti saama, kɛlɛ de ɠula zii ɠiligiti pɛ saama. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Eɠɛʋelei é bogai la Wozé ná-sɛʋɛi zu, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">«Zɔi é la ɠɛni ga nà-nuɓusɛ, nà naa loli ga nà-nuɓusɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">zii é la ɠɛni nɛɛni bɛ̀, gè naa loli ga nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 2:25">Woz 2:25</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>«Ʋɛ GALA ge ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ti ma ná: ‹Wo la ga nà-nuɓusɛa›,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">ta loli miná ga: ‹Zɛnvu su ƓALAGI ná-dointi›.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 2:1">Woz 2:1</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Ezayi kpee looni Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ta-vaa zu, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">«Anɛɛ ni Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ta mɔinzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">eɠɛʋelei kpoloɗɛi ɠobaʋɛ ma ɲaɠaegi la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">mɔta go nɔ ɠa a ɠizo.<verse eid="ROM 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Maliɠii ɠa wooi ɠaavɔnigai pɛ pilɛ su ga maavilɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:28">é kɛ eteai zu, eɠɛʋelei ná-devei la.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:27-28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 10:22-23">Eza 10:22-23</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Eɠɛʋelei Ezayi boni la mɔunpa, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">«Ni Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii la ɠɛni ade-mavofodai yɛni ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">ada la ɠɛ ga Sɔdɔme ɠɛʋele nɔ kpein,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">ada la ɠula nɔ kpein ga Gomɔɔl.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Eza 1:9</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle ta Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Lee ɠa da bo mu naazu? Zii ɠiligiti niiti ti la ɠɛa telebo faa ɠaiziɛzu, naati ti telebodai zɔlɔɔga, telebodai é zɔlɔɔsu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele. <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Tama Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti, ti ɠɛni tɔgi ɠaiziɛzu, ti ʋa ɠɛ ga telebo nu GALA gaazu, ti la naama lɔgi zɔlɔɔni. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Leeni vaa zu? Tɔɔzei Izilayɛle ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu, é ɠɛ ga telebo nu, kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni gaiziɛni ga kidaaleʋei, kɛni kɛɛwotiiti su. Ti-ɠɔɠɔi ziɠani kɔtui ʋa, é ga kɔɠɔziɠa ɠɔtui, <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la GALA Sɛʋɛi zu, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">«Wɛlɛ, nà kɔtu laazu Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">nii nu ɠɔɠɔ ɠa ziɠa ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">fasai nu ɠa ɓunɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">zɔi a ɠidaaleʋe ma, naa la unfega.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Eza 28:16</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="s">Zuifuiti ta zii ɠiligiti <optbreak/> ta-ƓALAGI ɠa ɠila nɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nii wɔin mà zìimaʋɛ, gè falizu GALA ma Zuifuiti faa zu, naa ɠa é ga ti ɠizo. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà naama zeele wooi wo ti ʋɛ, ga GALA ná-fai wɔin ɠa ti ma gola, kɛlɛ ma vaaɠaaɠai ɠa é la ti ya. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Ti la gaaɠaani ʋelei GALA ge nuiti kɛɛzu la ɠaazu ga telebo nui, ti ɠaaɓaaʋɛ ti ti ɓɔɠɔ vaiti kpɛtɛ, ti ʋa ɠɛ ga telebo nuiti. Naa ma, ti la vaani naa wu, ʋelei GALA ge nuiti kɛɛzu la ga telebo nuiti. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Kilista ɠa é ga tɔgi laazeeliai, naa ɠa a kɛ niiti kpein ti ɠidaaleʋezu, GALA ge naati kɛ ɠaazu ga telebo nuiti.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Wɛlɛ nii ɠa Moize sɛʋɛni, é lo telebodai ʋa, nui a sɔlɔɔ tɔgi zogai maaʋele ma: «Zɔi a ziɛ ga tɔ gooiti, naa ɠa zɛnvui wo ti maaʋele ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Kɛlɛ wɛlɛ, ʋelei telebodai é zɔlɔɔsu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele, naa ɓɔɛzu la, é ɠɛ ma: «Mina bo è-yiimaʋɛ ga: ‹Ɓɛ ɠa a lɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu?› (naa ɠa ga è Kilista yei, è kula ná), <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>ɓaa è ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɓɛ ɠa a yei zeɠezaɠa ɓokulagi zu?› » (naa ɠa ga è Kilista wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya). <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Leeni ɠa é bosu deɠɛmu? «Wooi ɠa è ɠoba nɔ, toɠa è-laaʋɛ ta è-yiimaʋɛ.» Naama wooi ɠa ga kidaaleʋe ɓɔɛi, nii gi daazeelizu.<verse eid="ROM 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Ni ɗa bona laaʋɛ ga Yesu ɠa ga Maliɠii, è la da è-yiimaʋɛ ga GALA ge buzeɠeni, é kula saai ya, GALA ka è ɠizo. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nui a laana da yiimaʋɛ, GALA ka kɛ ɠaazu ga telebo nu, a bona ga laaʋɛ, GALA ge kizo. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Eɠɛʋelei GALA Sɛʋɛi bogai la, é ɠɛ ma: «Zɔi nɔpɛ a ɠidaaleʋe ma, naa la unfega.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Eza 28:16</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zeeɠaaɠwɛɛzu la Zuifuiti ba, ta zɔiti ti la ga Zuifua. Mazɔlɔɔ ti pɛ ti-Maliɠii ɠa ɠila kpe nɔ, nii é faaɓɔɠɔi ɠɛɛzu naati pɛ bɛ, niiti ti wooɠulazu ma. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: «Zɔi nɔpɛ a wooɠula Maliɠii ma, toɠa ɠizo.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 3:5">Zow 3:5</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Ta zoo ti wooɠula ma ɠale, ni ti la ɠidaaleʋeni ma? Tama ta zoo ti ɠidaaleʋe ma ɠale, ni ti la ná-faa mɛnini? Ta zoo ná-fai mɛnisu ɠale, ni nu la daazeelini ti ma? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>GALA daawoo laazeeli nuiti ta ɠɛ ná ɠale, ni nu la ti leʋeni? Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: «Pagɛ gola ga nu wɛlɛ keelaiti ba, ti ɗa ʋa ga woo niinɛ ʋagɔi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Eza 52:7</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Kɛlɛ nui pɛ ge la Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi zoni. Tama Ezayi ɠɛni ma: «Màliɠii, ɓɛ ɠa é ɠidaaleʋea naa ma, é mɛniga gi la?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Eza 53:1</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Naa ɠa é ba, kidaaleʋei ɠa zɔlɔɔsu ga faa mɛnigi maaʋele, nii ma nu mɛnisu, naa ɠa ɠulazu Kilista ná-fai laazeeliai zu.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un gè ɠɛ ma: Ti la ɠɛni niima wooi mɛnini ɓaa? Ɓa-o! É la zɛʋɛni ɓaa, ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">«Ti-ma wooi laazeelini eteai zu ná pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">ti-wooi zeelini zou ɓela ga.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 19:5">Guy 19:5</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un gè ɠɛ ma: Izilayɛle la ɠɛni gaaɠaani ɓaa? Moize mɔunpa ge ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">«Nà wo ɠɛɛzu ga tolo nuiti ga naa maaʋele, nii é la ga zii nɔpɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">Nà wo yiiɠaawanazu ga zii ta, nii ɠi ge la ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">TSV 32:21</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Ezayi kulani dualuagi zu feya, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">«Zɔiti ti la ɠɛni gàiziɛzu, naati ti kàani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">gè ɠulani kɛlɛma naati bɛ, niiti ti la ɠɛni màaɠaazaɠabosu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 65:1">Eza 65:1</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Kɛlɛ é nii woni Izilayɛle ná-faa zu, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">«Yeenɔpɛ ka zèe maalegai la nuɓusɛiti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">ti la ɠoloni, ti maaɠaaliai.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 65:2">Eza 65:2</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ge la ɠɛlɛni Izilayɛle ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Nà gaazaɠa bosu: GALA kɛlɛʋɛ nɛi ná-nuɓusɛiti ba ɓaa? Ɓa-o, naa li poun! Mazɔlɔɔ nà ɓɔɠɔi nà ga Izilayɛle nui, Abalaame mavofodai, gè ɠɛ ga Ɓɛnzamɛn ná-bolodai zu nui ta. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>GALA ge la ɠɛlɛni ná-nuɓusɛiti ba, é yiimazeɠeni ga tiye ná luɠɔ. Wo naa ɠwɛɛ kɛlɛ, nii GALA Sɛʋɛi bogai, ʋɛ Eli ɠɛni ɓalasu ná GALA goi zu ga Izilayɛle ná-faa ga: <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>«Màliɠii, ti è-laawoo wo nuiti paa, ti ɗa-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti koloɠolo, nà ɠila ka niina zɛ̀gai ʋoluzu, nà ɓalaagi ta pɔ ga ti pàa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1Ma 19:10</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge gooɠaaʋoteni ɠale? É ɠɛni ma: «Gè nu waadɔfela (7.000) makɛgɛ ʋɛ, niiti ti la ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa Ɓaale ʋɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1Ma 19:18</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Zekana é la niima yeeɠɛɠalai zu, nui mɔta goiti ta ná, GALA ge yiimazeɠeai ga tiye ga ná-zaalai maaʋele. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>É yiimazeɠeni ga tiye ga ná-zaalai maaʋele, ta-ɠɛɛwotiiti maaʋele laade, ni naa laade, GALA ná-zaalai la levea ga zaala ɠiteɠite.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Leeni ɠa a wo naazu? Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ti la naa zɔlɔɔni, nii ti ɠɛni gaiziɛzu. Kɛlɛ zɔiti GALA ge yiimazeɠeni ga tiye, naati ti sɔlɔɔni. Mɔtaiti kigi ɓaani ti ɠoozu, <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>eɠɛʋelei GALA Sɛʋɛi bosu la, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">«GALA ge faaɠaaɠalala yɛnvui vea ti ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">ta wozaɠaalala ɠaazuʋɛ, ta faa mɛnitala woiyeɠei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">eyɛsu zaaɠaza.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 29:3">TSV 29:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Eza 29:10</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Davide ɓalaagi ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">«Ta-laami maaɓɔgi ɠɛ ti ʋɛ ga balii, ta ti zo tumɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">é ɠɛ ti ʋɛ ga ti loo zaɓui, ta ti-zalai!<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Ti-ɠaazuʋɛ ɓidi, ti mina wozaɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">è ti-zaamaʋɛ ɓili eyɛsu ɠɔ!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9-10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:23-24">Guy 69:23-24</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Nà gaazaɠa bosu: Siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɓunɛga la, ti loa ɠana ná bu mɛtu ɓaa? Ɓa-o, naa li poun! Kɛlɛ ta-vaaɠaazagi maaʋele ma, zii ɠiligi zɔiti ti kizogi zɔlɔɔga, naa toloi wuzeɠea Zuifuiti ziimaʋɛ ti laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Ni ta-vaaɠaazagi ɠɛa ga kpɛtɛ zaɓui eteai pɛ bɛ, ta ta-loobui ɠɛ ga kpɛtɛ vaa zii ɠiligiti bɛ, kulanuma wola lielegɔ ɠa a zɔlɔɔ, siɛgi zu ti pɛ ti ɠaavɔnisu la?<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zii ɠiligiti ta-ɠizo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Zii ɠiligiti, wa ɠa gè ɓɔɛzu wo ʋɔ, nɛ̀i gè ga zii ɠiligiti wa-ɠeelai, nà nà-botii maamusɛzu. <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>Ni ma zobo ka ná, nà pɔ gè kɛ ʋele-o-ʋele, gè toloi lɔ naati kigi zu, gá niiti gi ga zii ɠilagi, nii a kɛ tanigaani ti kizogi zɔlɔɔ ti zaama. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Tama siɛgi zu ti likpini da, naa ɠɛa ga zɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛi eteai ta GALA ti yɔɠɔzu, siɛgi zu zeezeibui wosu la ga tiye, leeni ɠa a ɠɛ naazu? Toɠa ɠɛ ga zɛnvui naati bɛ, niiti ti zaani!<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Ni ɓului ma mɔungiti kulaʋɛ GALA bɛ, mɔtai pɛ ka ga nɔnɔ ɓalaa, ni ma zapei ɠa ga GALA nɔnɔ, ma ɓekegiti pɛ ta ɠɛ ɠana nɔ ɓalaa. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Kɛlɛ ni ma ɓekegi tanigaani ti vologa ba, ni ɗɛi è ga dɔɓɔzu wolive wului ma ʋɔnɔgi, è loga ma lɔkulugi ʋa ti-ʋotogi zu, wo ɓɔga ma zapei ma ta su ɗɛi, <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>mina waso ma ɓekegi zɔiti ma, ti vologai ba. Ni ɗa wasona, kwɛɛ è ɠɛ ma, ma zapei lɛi é ʋa ɠɛ loni è ʋa, kɛlɛ ɗɔun ka è loni ma zapei ʋa, é ɗa è zeɠe. <verse eid="ROM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Ɗa ɠɛ ma naazu: «Ma ɓekegiti ti voloni ba, nii a kɛ gè lo ba ti-ʋotogi zu.» <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Naa ɠa ga gaama. Ti voloni ba ta-ɠidaaleʋelalai maaʋele ma, ɗɔun è tosuʋɛ tɔna sɔlɔɔga kidaaleʋei maaʋele ma. Dama, è mina waso, kɛni è lua. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni GALA ge la ma ɓeke kiteiti gaazumaawɔinɠaani, é ʋa ti yɛ ná, é la è ɠaazumaawɔinɠaa, é ʋa è yɛ ná. <verse eid="ROM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>GALA ná-nuɓɔɠɔlai ta ná-gaazumaavɔi ʋɛtɛ, gaazumaavɔi naati tetema, niiti ti looni, ná-nuɓɔɠɔlai è letema, ni ɗa yɛna nuɓɔɠɔlai naa zu. Ni naa laade, ɗa ɓalaagi ɗa leʋezu ga. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Tiya ɓalaagi, ni ti la yɛni ta-ɠidaaleʋelalai zu, ʋɛ ti ɠɛni loni ná, ta lo miná ʋolu, mazɔlɔɔ zobogi ɠa GALA bɛ, é ti lo ná ʋolu. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Ni è leʋeʋɛ ga, è ɠula dɔɓɔzu wolive wului ʋa, è lo wolive wulu ɠitei ʋa, nii siingai, kula kazemazui ɠana. Tiya ma, tago pa ge la ɓaani ga ti ʋa nɔ, ti lo ti ɓɔɠɔ wolive wului ʋa, é ga ti-ma lɔkulu pɔlɔmai.<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti kizo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gè pɔ ga gè GALA ná-faazeikpasui ma lɔɔɠuzu vai lɛ ga woye, nii a kɛ wo mina ɓɔɠɔ leve ga ɠima nu wolaiti. Izilayɛle ɠilazuʋɛ ɠa yɛsu kikpaai zu, eyɛsu zii ɠiligiti tiegɔi ɠaavɔni GALA ná-nuɓusɛiti saama. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Izilayɛle pɛ ka ɠizo, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la GALA Sɛʋɛi zu, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">«Unmɔɔ nu ɠa ʋaazu, é zeɠe Siyɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">toɠa kololala vai pɛ kula Zakɔɓe mavofodaiti zea.<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>Minai ɠa nà seɠe ti ʋɛ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26-27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 59:20-21">Eza 59:20-21</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">siɛgi zu gè ta-ɠotoiti suvaayɛsu da.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 27:9">Eza 27:9</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi letemazu, ta ga GALA sili nuiti wa-vaa zu, kɛlɛ GALA ná-ziimazeɠegi letemazu, ta ga naati GALA ge ti nɛai ʋɛ, ti-mɛmɛwolani maaʋele ma. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ná-vebɛaniiti ta ná-toligiti maa la valiboga. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Mɔungi zu, wa ɓalaagi wo kololalai ɠɛɛni GALA daawooi ʋɛ, kɛlɛ niizu wo GALA ná-maawɔinɠai zɔlɔɔga, tɔɔzei Zuifuiti ta-ɠololalai ʋa. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Zekana nɔ, ti kololalai ɠɛa niizuʋɛ, nii a kɛ wo GALA ná-gaazumaawɔinɠai zɔlɔɔ, kɛlɛ naa ɠa a kɛ, tiya ɓalaagi ti zoo ti gaazumaawɔinɠaa ɠilagi naa ɓɔɠɔi zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge ɛsɛ pɛ devea ga woozotala nuiti, naa ɠa a kɛ, ɛsɛ pɛ ge ná-gaazumaawɔinɠai zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-lɛbiyai wɔɔlɔ ʋelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Ee, GALA ná-kpɛtɛi zuwɔɔlɔʋɛ, ta ná-ɠimalai, ta ná-faaɠwɛgi! Nu la zooga a ʋa ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋe vaiti gaaɠa, nu la ná-faazeikpasuiti gaaɠaa! <verse eid="ROM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>Sɛʋɛʋɛ ɠani GALA Sɛʋɛi zu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">«Ɓɛ ɠa é Maliɠii ná-kisiɛi ɠwɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é ɠɛ ga tɛnɛ nui?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Eza 40:13</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>«Ɓɛ ɠa é ani vea tɔun bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">ga naa ʋa potogi zala ma?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 41:3">Zɔɓ 41:3</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Anii pɛ ka zeɠezu pɔ bɛ, ti pɛ ta tɔun saalai nɔ zu, ti pɛ ta ná tɔnɔ ʋɛ. Lɛbiyai ɠɛ tɔun bɛ, eyɛsu ɠɔ. Amina!<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s">È ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ ga zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu GALA ná-maawɔinɠai maaʋele ma, ga wo ɓɔɠɔ ve GALA bɛ ga zalaɠai é vulua, ɲadegai, nɛai GALA bɛ. Naa ɠa é ga GALA dɛbi ʋele ɠitei, nii soloogai ga wo ɗa fe bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>À mina ʋokɔɠɔ niima eteai zu vaiti ma, kɛlɛ à va bu wo valibo ga wa-ɠisiɛiti niinɛai maaʋele, wa zoo naazu wo GALA ziimai ɠaaɠa, nii pagai, nii nɛai bɛ, nii daazeeliai.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Zaalai nii GALA ge daa mà, naa maaʋele ɠa gè ɠɛɛzu la wo ɠilagilagi pɛ ma, tanɔpɛ ge mina ɠisiɛ ɓɔɠɔ zu, é ʋa teʋe kɛɛzu ʋa. Kɛlɛ kɛni wo ɗa kisiɛ ʋagɔi wo, eɠɛʋelei GALA ge kidaaleʋei ɠɔɠɔgai la, é gaaɠwɛ ɛsɛ pɛ ba. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Kpusɛ ɠilagi ʋaalobazuʋɛti mɔinʋɛ, kɛlɛ ti pɛ ti la boti zii ɠila kɛɛzu. <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>Zekana ade la, anɛɛ ni de mɔinʋɛ, de pɛ da ga kpusɛ ɠilagi, de ɠiliai Kilista ʋa, de ɠilagilagi de ɠiliʋɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, eɠɛʋelei kpusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛti ti la. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>De-losuʋɛti ma vebɛaniiti ti la ɓɔni, eɠɛʋelei zaalai la feai ade ʋɛ. Ni GALA goo wo fai ɠa feai de ta ʋɛ, maanɛɛʋɛ, é naa ɠɛ, é zoloo kidaaleʋei ma. <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Zɔi tosuʋɛ ga é boti ɠɛ, naa boti ɠɛ. Zɔi tosuʋɛ ga é kalagi wo, naa kalagi wo. <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>Zɔi é iɲɔdɔɔi wosu, naa iɲɔdɔɔi wo. Zɔi é faaɓɔɠɔi ɠɛɛzu, é kɛ ga faanɛɛi. Zɔi é totuɠɔlai ɠɛɛzu, é kɛ ga pagɔ. Zɔi é maanɔɠɔ nuiti gaazumaawɔinɠaazu, naa kɛ ga koozunɛɛi.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Wooveledai mina ɠɛ nɛɛbɛi zu. À faa ɲɔi wɔinzeɠe, wo ɠili kpe faa ʋagɔi ʋa. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>À wɔin ga ɓɔɠɔ wo ɠilagilagi pɛ ga kɛɛɠɛloun nɛɛbɛi. À ɓɔɠɔ wɔɔlɔ, wo ɗa leʋe ɓɔɠɔ ʋa naa zu. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>À ɠɛ ga botiɠɛ nu, wo mina ɠɛ ga dɔɔʋɛ nu. À botii ɠɛ Maliɠii ʋɛ ga wo-yiimaʋɛ pɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>À ɠoozunɛ wa-ɠitogi zu. À yiilɔɔ kpɔlɔi zu. À ɠaaɓa GALA falii ma yeenɔpɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>À ɓɔ GALA ná-nuiti ba ti-maavaiti su. À yeezei wɛɛinti bu yeenɔpɛ su.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>À tuya loo naati bɛ, niiti ti wo wɔinzeɠezu. À tuyai loo, à mina foovoo loo. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>À ɠoozunɛ wa naati, niiti ti ɠoozunɛai, wo wɔlɔ wa naati, niiti ti wɔlɔzu. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>À zoloo su wo ɠilagilagi. À mina ɠisiɛ faa wolaiti su, kɛni faa goiti. À mina waso, wo ʋa ɓɔɠɔ leve ga ɠima nu wa ɓɔɠɔi wo ɠaazu.<verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>À mina nu nɔpɛ ná-faa ɲɔi ʋotokula ga faa ɲɔi. À ɠaaɓa faa ʋagɔi ɠɛɛ vai ma ɛsɛ pɛ gaazu. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Ni toɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu, ʋelei wa zoo la da, à ɠɛ ziilɛigi zu wa nuɓusɛiti pɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔiti, à mina wɔnɔ ʋotokula wa ɓɔɠɔi. À GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai yɛ ná, é botii ɠɛ, mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:19">«Nà ɠa gè ga potokula nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:19">nà ɠa nà sala, Maliɠii wooi ɠana.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:25">TSV 32:25</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Kɛlɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">«Ni pului ɠa è zili nui ma, daamianigi ve zea, é mi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">ni kpɔɔle wɔin ɠa ma, kɔ, é ɓɔɔle,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠɛna naa ɠɛa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 12:20">abulekaiti kana è puuzu unmaʋɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">TFa 25:21-22</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Mina va bu faa ɲɔi ʋa zobo sɔlɔɔ è ma, kɛni tɔun è ɠɛ ga zobo sɔlɔɔ nu faa ɲɔi ma ga faa ʋagɔi.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s">Ɠolo zobobɛ nuiti bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠolo zobobɛ nu wolaiti bɛ, mazɔlɔɔ zoboda nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii é la zeɠeni GALA pɔ. Zobobɛ nuiti ti ná, GALA ka é naati seiɗa. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zɔi nɔpɛ a wuzeɠe zobobɛ nui laalɔɠɔma, é wuzeɠea GALA ná-devei laalɔɠɔma, é seiɗai. Niiti ta wuzeɠe daalɔɠɔma, naati ta ɓɔɠɔ ʋeelalazu. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kundiɠiiti ti la zeini faa ʋagɔ ɠɛ nu laalɔɠɔma, kɛni faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui. Ɗa pɔ ga è mina lua zobobɛ nui ʋa, kɛlɛ? Faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ, toɠa è maamusɛ naazu. <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ga GALA ná-botiɠɛ nui è letemazu, faa ʋagɔi ɠɛɛ vai zu. Kɛlɛ ni ɗa faa ɲɔi ɠɛɛna, lua! Mazɔlɔɔ é la boɠa zɔkpɔi zeɠezu wafuun. Toɠa ga GALA ná-botiɠɛ nui, é ɗa potokulai ɠɛ, é faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nui nɔnɔ ma zalai ve zea. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Naa ɠa é ba, fizɔgɛ ga nu ɠolo zobobɛ nuiti bɛ, é la nɔ ga nii a kɛ GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai ʋoola è ʋa, kɛlɛ ɗa-ɠisiɛi vaa zu ɓalaa.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛzu wo muluiti kulazu. Mazɔlɔɔ zobobɛ nuiti ta ga GALA ná-botiɠɛ nuiti, nii a kɛ ti niima vaiti kɛ ga kɛʋele. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>À naa ve ɛsɛ zea, nii maanɛai wo fe zea. À mului ve naa ya, nii maanɛai wo mului ve zea. À aniiti ma mului ve naa ya, nii maanɛai wo aniiti ma mului ve zea. À unfemai ve naa ʋɛ, nii maanɛai unfemai ve bɛ. À naa wɔɔlɔ, nii maanɛai wo bɔɔlɔ.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Seiɲɔɠɔ nɛɛbɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Nu nɔpɛ ná-kuye mina yɛ wo ma, kɛni nɛɛbɛi nɔ a ɠɛ wo yɔɠɔzu ga kuyei wo ɠilagilagiti. Mazɔlɔɔ zɔi a zɔiti nɛɛna ʋɛ, naa ɠoloa tɔgi ʋɛ mɛtu. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ tɔgiti ti ɠɛɛzu ma: «Mina wɛɛnziɛ bo, mina nu ʋaa, mina unma wo, mina gaazuɠulapɔ ɠɛ,» naati ta tɔgi taɠiligaani, ta deve ɠila kpegi nii zu, é ɠɛɛzu ma: «È-zeiɲɔɠɔi nɛɛ ʋɛ, eɠɛ ɗa ɓɔɠɔi.» <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Nɛɛbɛi la faa ɲɔu ɠɛa ga seiɲɔɠɔi, naa ɠa é ba, nɛɛbɛi ɠa é ga tɔgi laazeeliai.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Foloi maaɓuɠaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Naa pɛ poluma, wo suɠwɛɛ yeeɠɛɠalai ade su, wo un geei ɠa wo ɠula wa-ɲiimɛnii zu. Kizo fai maaɓuɠaa de ʋa niizu, é leʋe naama ziɛgi zu ʋa, de ɠidaaleʋeni la. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Gee maalia, geelaa ɠana lao. Naa ɠa é ba, ade ɠɛlɛ kɛɛwoti ɲɔiti ba, ti ɠɛɛzu kpidii zu. Ade wozakalagi nɔnɔ ma ɠɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti seɠe. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Ade ziɛ fɔɔn letema, é zoloo wozakalagi ná-fai ma. Ade dama ga ziimaɠɛɛ lateʋegai, ta dɔɔzodai, ta wɛɛnziɛgi, ta ɓaaɠulama vai, ta kpɔɛ vaiti, ta tolo ɲɔi. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Kɛlɛ à Maliɠii Yesu Kilista loo ɠɔba, wo mina mɔ yiizoolɛ ga kpusɛi yiimaiti, wo ʋa ná-gaazuɠulapɔ vaiti kɛ.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s">Unfe è-ɠɛɛloin ma kidaaleʋei zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Zɔi zɛbɛ la zea kidaaleʋei zu, à yeezei bu, wo mina ɗa ga ná-kisiɛiti ma lukpɔ ɠaaleʋe. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ta ɠidaaleʋeʋɛ ga toɠa zoo é anii pɛ mi, tama zɔi zɛbɛ la zea kidaaleʋei zu, naa ɠa tufa wuluwulugiti nɔ miizu. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Zɔi é anii pɛ miizu, naa mina zɔi ʋɛlɛʋili, nii é la anii pɛ miizu. Zɔi ɓalaagi é la anii pɛ miizu, naa mina zɔi lukpɔɠaaleʋe, nii é anii pɛ miizu, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge yeezeiɗa bu. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Ɓɛ ɠa ga ɗe, ɗɛi è è-waani ta-wotiɠɛ nui lukpɔɠaaleʋezu? É loni kpaan, ɓaa é looni, zɔi é botii ɠɛɛzu bɛ, naa ná-faa ɠana. Kɛlɛ toɠa lo kpaan, mazɔlɔɔ zobogi ɠa Maliɠii ʋɛ, é to kpaan.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Nui ta ɠa ɗa ɠisiɛ ga foloi ta leʋegɛ ta ʋa, taɠili ge ɠisiɛ ga foloiti pɛ ta ga ani ɠila. Ɛsɛ pɛ ge naa leve, é la da ɓɔɠɔ yiimaʋɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Zɔi é foloi ta vizɔsu ta ʋa, naa ɠa naa ɠɛɛzu ga é Maliɠii lɛbi. Zɔi ɓalaagi é anii pɛ miizu, naa ɠa naa ɠɛɛzu ga é Maliɠii lɛbi, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa GALA mamasu ná-daamianigi vaa zu. Zɔi ɓalaagi é la anii pɛ mia, naa ɠa naa ɠɛɛzu ga é Maliɠii lɛbi, toɠa mamagi veezu GALA bɛ.<verse eid="ROM 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Tama de tanɔpɛ ge la zɛnvui wosu ɓɔɠɔ nɔ ʋɛ, nu nɔpɛ ge la zaazu ɓɔɠɔ nɔ ʋɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni ada zɛnvui wosu, da zɛnvui wosu Maliɠii ʋɛ, ni ada zaana, da zaazu Maliɠii ʋɛ. Naa ɠa é ba, ade ɠɛni vulua, ɓaa ade zaani, ada ga Maliɠii nɔnɔiti. <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Kilista zaani, é vulu su ʋolu, ga é ɠɛ ga gɔvɛiti ta fulu nuiti Maliɠii. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Kɛlɛ ɗa ʋe, leeni vaa zu è è-ɠɛɛloin lukpɔɠaaleʋezu? Ɗa ʋe, leeni vaa zu è è-ɠɛɛloin ʋɛlɛʋilisu? Mazɔlɔɔ ade pɛ da ɠaalɔ GALA kakala ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">«Maliɠii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">nuɓusɛi kpein ka ʋilɛ ɲiibiɠa, ti nɔkɔ bù,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">ti-nɛgiti ti GALA dɛbi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Eza 45:23</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, de ɠilagilagi pɛ ka ʋoluvaawo GALA ma, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-faa zu.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mina è-ɠɛɛloin loo kotoi zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Ade ɓe deɠɛmu ɓɔɠɔ ʋeelala vai ʋa, de ɠilagilagiti. Ade deve tɔun ga de mina ɠɛ ga de-ɠɛɛloun ɠɔɠɔziɠa zaɓu, ɓaa too zaɓu kotoi zu. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Da-ɠilibalai zu da Maliɠii Yesu, gè kwɛɛ ga anii tanɔpɛ ge la ɠɔzɔni kpɛtɛ ʋelei ma. Kɛlɛ ni nui ta ɠa ɠisiɛzu ga anii ta ɠɔzɔʋɛ, naa ɠɔzɔʋɛ tɔun bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Ni ɗa è-ɠɛɛloin yiiɓɔlɔna daamiani fai nɔ zu, è la mɔ ziɛzu ga nɛɛbɛi. Ɗa-laamiani fai mina ɠɛ ga zaɓu, è ʋa naa undaaʋili, nii Kilista zaai ná-faa zu. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Nii pagai è ɠaazu, naa mina ɠɛ tanigaani bɛ ga zaɓui, ti ʋa ɗa woo ɲɔi wo è ma. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ná-masadai la ga daamii ta kpɔɔlei, kɛlɛ toɠa ga telebodai, ta ziilɛigi, ta koozunɛɛi, nii Zɛnvu Ɲadegai feezu. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Zɔi é botii ɠɛɛzu Kilista ʋɛ ga niima ɠɛʋelei, naama nui ná-fai ʋagɛ GALA gaazu, nuiti ti la peelalaa.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ade naama vaiti gaiziɛ yeenɔpɛ, nii a ɠɛ ga ziilɛigi, é ɓɔ de ʋa, de li luɠɔma kidaaleʋei zu. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>À mina GALA ná-botii ɠoloɠolo daamianigi ná-faa zu. Gaama ʋe ga daamianigi pɛ ka zoo miizu, kɛlɛ toɠa ga faa ɲɔu, è anii ta mi, naa ɠɛ ga è-ɠɛɛloin loa kotoi zu. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Nii fizɔgai, naa ɠa ga è mina suai mi, è mina dɔɔi ɓɔle, è ɠɛlɛ naa pɛ ba, nii a zoo è è-ɠɛɛloin loo kotoi zu. <verse eid="ROM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Nii è laai da kidaaleʋei zu, naa makɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ GALA gaazu. Undaanɛ nu ɠa ga naama nui, nii é la ɓɔɠɔ ʋeelalazu ɠaazu ná-deveiti su, é ti wosu! <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi inɛinɛgi ziimaʋɛ, é lo daamianigi ʋa é miizu, naa peelalai zɔlɔɔga, tɔɔzei é la mɔ kɛɛni ga kidaaleʋei. Tama faa nɔpɛ é ɠɛɛzu, é la ɠɛɛzu ga kidaaleʋei, naa ɠɛa ga kotoi.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s">Nii ɗa kɛ è nɛɛ zeiɲɔɠɔi ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Adɛiti de-zɛbɛi wɔɔlɔai kidaaleʋei zu, de maanɛɛʋɛ de yiilɔɔ naati ta-zɛbɛsulalai wu, niiti ti la ga de ɠɛʋele, de mina ʋilɛ de ɓɔɠɔyiimai nɔ ʋolu. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Kɛni de ɠilagilagi pɛ de ɠaaɓa de de-zeiɲɔɠɔi yiima vai ɠɛ, é ɠɛ ga faa ʋagɔ bɛ, ga é li luɠɔma kidaaleʋei zu. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ anɛɛ Kilista ɓɔɠɔi la ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔyiima vaa ɠɛɛni. Kɛlɛ sɛʋɛʋɛ mu GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:3">«È ʋoomu nuiti ta-ʋoomugiti ti zeelia mà.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:10">Guy 69:10</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Tama fai niiti kpein ti zɛʋɛai mɔungi, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ de ɠala fai ma, naa ɠa a kɛ ade kitogi zɔlɔɔ ziilɔɔi maaʋele ma ta gaanɛɛnɛi, GALA Sɛʋɛi ti veezu de ya. <verse eid="ROM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>GALA nii é ziilɔɔi veezu, é gaanɛɛnɛi wo, naa ma zobogi ve wo ya, wo ɠɛ ga koozu ɠisiɛ ɠila bo nu, eɠɛʋelei Yesu Kilista ɠɛʋelei la, <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, wo zoloo faa ɠila ma, woo ɠilagi zu, wo ɗa GALA dɛbi, nii é ga de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista Kɛɛɠɛ.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi nuɓusɛiti pɛ faa ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>À yeezei ɓɔɠɔ wu wo ɠilagilagi pɛ, eɠɛʋelei Kilista yeezeiɗai la wo wu, GALA ná-lɛbiyai vaa ma. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà bosu wo ma ga: Kilista ɠɛni ga Zuifuiti ta-wotiɠɛ nui, ga é ʋa GALA ná-minazeɠegiti daazeeli, é ti ɠɛɛni ti-mɛmɛwolani bɛ, ta é GALA ná-gaamai ɠula kɛlɛma ga pagɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>É ʋaani ɓalaa, nii a kɛ zii ɠiligiti ti GALA dɛbi ná-gaazumaawɔinɠai ma vaa zu, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la GALA Sɛʋɛi zu, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">«Naa ɠa é ba, nà è maamusɛ zii ɠiligiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">gè guyei loo è-laaseigi lɛbi vaa ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2Sa 22:50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:50">Guy 18:50</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Sɛʋɛʋɛ mɔnɔ, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">«Zii ɠiligiti, à ɠoozunɛ ʋɔɔma, wa ná-nuɓusɛiti!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">TSV 32:43</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>É ɠɛ ma naa ʋolu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">«Ziiti kpein, à Maliɠii maamusɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">Nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti maamusɛ!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">Guy 117:1</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Ezayi ɓalaagi ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">«Izayi mavofodai ɠa ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">toɠa wuzeɠe, é masadai ɠɛ ziiti unda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">ziiti pɛ ta ɠito tɔun ba.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 11:10">Eza 11:10</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Kito GALAGI ɓɔɠɔi wo laave ga koozunɛɛi, ta ná-ziilɛigi pɛ kidaaleʋei zu. Naazu wo-yii laa ɠa ve ga kitogi, é ʋooʋa ma Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɛbɛi zu.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ná-botii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nà ɓɔɠɔgoi, kìsuɠalagɛ wa-vaa zu, ga wo laavegɛ ga kɛʋele ʋagɔi pɛ, ta faaɠwɛgi pɛ, wa zoosu ɓalaagi wo ɗa ɓɔɠɔ lɛnɛ wo ɠilagilagi pɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, kɛʋelei tanigaani su, gè sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛni wo ma ga ziilɔɔi, gè wo ɠitoo naama vaiti su wo ti ɠwɛɛ, zaalai maaʋele ma nii GALA ge daai mà, <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>ga gè ɠɛ ga Yesu Kilista ná-botiɠɛ nui zii ɠiligiti bɛ, nà zalaɠa ɠula wotii ɠɛɛzu ga gè ɗa GALA ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli, naa ɠa a kɛ zii ɠiligiti ti ɠɛ ga zalaɠai nɛai GALA bɛ, ɲadegai Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ya. <verse eid="ROM 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Gá-ɠilibalai maaʋele ma gá Yesu Kilista, nà zoo gè ɓɔɠɔ maamusɛ GALA ná-botii zu. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gè la zooga gè ʋa faa nɔpɛ bo, kɛni nii Kilista kɛai ga nɔ̀un maaʋele, ga zii ɠiligiti ti ʋa, ti ɠolo GALA bɛ. É naa ɠɛɛni ga nà-kpɔɛzuɠulaiti ta nà-kɛɛwotiiti maaʋele, <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>ta laavɔɔ vai ma zɛbɛiti ta maaɓɛlɛ vaiti maaʋele, ta GALA Zɛnvui ná-zɛbɛi maaʋele. Ʋele ɠana gè Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelini la mɛtu, é ʋilɛ Kilista ʋa, é zo Zeluzalɛme ma, eyɛsu é zeeli Iliili yooi zu. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Kɛlɛ gè ɠaaɓaani, ʋɛ nɔpɛ Kilista laaseigi la ɠɛni dɛ woni ná, gè Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli miná, naa ɠa a kɛ gè mina pɛlɛi lo taɠili ná-seɓasemai maazu. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Gè kɛɛni, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la GALA Sɛʋɛi zu, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">«Zɔiti é la ɠɛni dɛ woni ti ma, naati ta ka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">zɔiti ti la ɠɛni dɛ ma woo mɛnini, naati ta gaaɠa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Eza 52:15</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle lii vai Wɔlɔme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Naa ɠa é pele leʋeni tùɠɔ siɛ mɔinmɔin su, gè ʋa li wo ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Kɛlɛ niizu niina, gè nà-botii ɓega niima yooi zu. Tɔɔzei kona mɔinmɔin daawu wɔin ɠɛni mà, ga gè ʋa, gè laali wo ma, <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>nà ɠisiɛzu ga gè naa ɠɛ, siɛgi zu gè liizu la Ɛsepaɲɛ yooi zu. Toɠa kìsu ga gè wo ɠa nà ɠɛna leʋega, gè wa-ɓɔbai zɔlɔɔ, gè lii la naama yooi zu, ada ɓɔɠɔ lago wɔinɠulana. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Niizuʋɛ, nà liizu Zeluzalɛme, kidaaleʋe nuiti maavaa ɠɛɛ vai ma. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Masedoane ta Akayi Egilisiiti ti deveʋɛ ga ti ani ɠaalɛ ba, ti ɓɔ da kidaaleʋe nuiti ba, ti ga bala nuiti Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Ti deveni tiya ɓɔɠɔi, kɛlɛ gaamazu, ti maanɛɛni ti naa ɠɛ, bala nui naati bɛ. Mazɔlɔɔ ni zii ɠiligiti ti tɔnɔ zɔlɔɔga zɛnvu zu vaiti su ga Zuifu ɠidaaleʋe nuiti maaʋele, tiya ɓalaa, ti maanɛɛʋɛ, ti ɓɔ naati ba ga ti-yeaɠɔligiti. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Nà ɓena feya ga niima vaiti gaaɓela, gè naama vebɛaniiti fe ti ya, nà ɠɛna lia Ɛsepaɲɛ, nà leʋe niina ga wo ʋɔ pelei. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Gè kwɛɛ gè ɠɛ, siɛgi zu gè ʋaazu la wo ʋɔ bɛ, nà ʋaazu ná ga Kilista ná-tuyai, nii daazeeliai mɛtu.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista maaʋele ma, ta Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-nɛɛbɛi maaʋele ma, ga wo ɓɔ bà, ade ɲɛpii ɠɔ bɛ̀ ga GALA faliiti. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>À GALA fali ga gè ɠizo Zudé ɠidaaleʋelala nuiti ma, vebɛaniiti gè liizu ga tiye Zeluzalɛme, kidaaleʋe nuiti ti yeezei ti wu ná ga pagɔ, <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, gè zeeli wo ʋɔ bɛ koozunɛɛi zu, GALA ga laana ga, nà lago looɠo wo zaama. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Ziilɛi fee ƓALAGI ɠɛ wo pɛ wo ʋa! Amina!<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ gooiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Nà ade-ʋaazeelai Feɓé ɠalivaazu wo ma, anzanui nii é boti ɠɛɛzu Sankelé Egilisii zu. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>À yeezei bu ga pagɔ de-Maliɠii laaseigi zu, ʋelei soloogai la GALA ná-nuiti ma. À ɠɛ zeema fai pɛ su, nii a ɓɛdɛ ma, é lo wo ʋa. Tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɓɔga nu mɔinmɔin ba, nà ɓɔɠɔi ɓalaagi.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>À Pilisile ta Akilaseni tuʋɔ, gá niiti gi botii ɠɛɛzu ʋɔɔma Yesu Kilista ná-fai zu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>Ti ɠikulani ti-yɛnvui zu, ti ʋa nɔ̀nɔi ɠizo. Nà ɠila nɔ laade, gè ʋa ɠɛ ga naa wuuɠwɛɛ nui ti ʋɛ, kɛlɛ zii ɠiligiti ta-Egilisiiti ɓalaa. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>À Egilisii luʋɔ, é gaalɛbai wosu ta-ʋɛlɛi wu. À nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔi Epayinɛte luʋɔ. Tɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ga nu mɔungi é ɠidaaleʋeni Kilista ma, Azi yooi zu. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>À Mali luʋɔ, nii é ɓɔlɔni gola wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>À nà-nuiti tuʋɔ Andelonikuseni ta Zuniase, gá tiyani ka gi ɠɛni kasoi ɠa ʋɔɔma. Ta ga nu wolaa keelaiti saama. Ti ɠidaaleʋeni Kilista ma nɔ̀un tuɠɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>À Amapiliatuse luʋɔ. Toɠa ga nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔi Maliɠii ná-fai zu. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>À Wuulebɛn luʋɔ, gá niiti gi boti ɠɛɛzu ʋɔɔma Kilista ná-fai zu, ta nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔi Setakise. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>À Apɛlɛse luʋɔ, nii é ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠulani kɛlɛma Kilista ná-fai zu. À Alisitobule ná-pɛlɛwu nuiti tuʋɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>À ná-nui Elɔdiɔn luʋɔ. À Naalesise ná-pɛlɛwu nuiti tuʋɔ, niiti ti ga Maliɠii nɔnɔiti. <verse eid="ROM 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>À Maliɠii ná-botiɠɛ anzanui niiti tuʋɔ bɛ̀, ti ga Tilifɛne ta Tilifɔze. À Pɛɛleside luʋɔ, nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔi, tɔ ɓalaa ka ga anzanu nii é boti mɔinmɔin kɛa Maliɠii ʋɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>À Lufuse luʋɔ, nii Maliɠii yiimazeɠeai la, ta dee, nii é ga nà ɓalaagi dèe. <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>À Asinkeliteni tuʋɔ, ta Felegɔn, ta Ɠɛɛlemɛse, ta Patɔlɔbase, ta Ɠɛɛlemase, ta de-ɠɛɛleaiti ti ada ɠila. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>À Filolɔgeni tuʋɔ, ta Zuli, ta Nelé, ta baazeelai, ta Wolimepase, ta kidaaleʋe nuiti pɛ ti ti ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>À ɓɔɠɔ luʋɔ ga nɛɛnɛi. Kilista ná-Egilisii pɛ ka wo luʋɔsu.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɛnɛ gaaɓelagiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu, à dama ga naati ta-vai, niiti ti gaaɠwɛɛ vai ɠɛɛzu, ti kidaaleʋe nuiti kakasu, ti ti wuzeɠezu kalagi laalɔɠɔma, nii wo sɔlɔɔgai. À maaɠooza ti ʋa. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ naama nu ziiti ti la boti ɠɛɛzu Kilista ʋɛ, de-Maliɠii, kɛni ti-ɠogi nɔ. Ta-ɓɔɛ ʋagɔiti ta nu lɛsu ɓɔɛiti maaʋele ma, ta kaka fai lɔɔzu nuiti ziimaʋɛ, niiti ti la ɠidaazu faa wu. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ge wa-ɠoloi ɠwɛɛ Maliɠii ʋɛ. Kòozunɛɛʋɛ deɠɛmu wa-vaa zu, kɛlɛ wɔ̀inʋɛ ga wo ɠɛ ga ɠima nuiti faa ʋagɔi ɠɛɛ vai zu, ta wo ɠɛ ga sɔbalala nuiti faa ɲɔi letemazu. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Ná tago ʋe niina, ziilɛi fee ƓALAGI ʋa é Setana ɠoloɠolo wo-ɠɔɠɔi wu. Ade-Maliɠii Yesu ná-zaalai yɛ wo ʋa!<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Timɔte ɠa wo luʋɔsu, gá tɔ ɠa gi botii ɠɛɛzu ʋɔɔma, Lusiyuse ɓalaagi, ta Zazɔn, ta Sozipatɛɛl, nà-nuiti.<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Nɛ̀i gè ga Tɛɛlɛsiyuse, gè niima zɛʋɛi ɠɛai Pɔle ʋɛ, nà wo luʋɔsu de-Maliɠii laaseigi zu.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Nà-wɛɛn kɛɛɠɛi Gaiyuse ɠa wo luʋɔsu, ná-pɛlɛi wu ɠa Egilisii pɛ ge ɠaalɛɛzu ba ná. Elasete, é ga taai ná-wali makɛ nui, ta ade-ɠɛɛloin Kaalatuse, naati ta wo luʋɔsu.<verse eid="ROM 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>[Ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ná-zaalai yɛ wo pɛ wo ʋa. Amina!]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maamusɛ ɠaaɓelagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Lɛbiyai ɠɛ GALA bɛ! Zobogi ɠa bɛ, é wo zɛbɛlɔ kidaaleʋei zu, é zoloo Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ma, nii gè daazeelizu, ta tɛnɛgi gè bosu Yesu Kilista ná-fai zu, eɠɛʋelei naama vaaɠwɛgi la gi sɔlɔɔni, GALA ná-faazeikpasui ma lɔɔɠuzu vai, nii dɔɔɠua ɠɛni de kaite wɔlɔwɔlɔ, <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>kɛlɛ niizu é ɠulaa kɛlɛma GALA goo wo nuiti ta-zɛʋɛiti su, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei la, ziiti pɛ ti faa ɠwɛɛga su, nii a kɛ ti ɠidaaleʋe, ti ɠolo bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Lɛbiyai ɠɛ ɠima ƓALA gila kpegi ʋɛ ga Yesu Kilista maaʋele, eyɛsu ɠɔ! Amina!<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
